"Debugging: Log AI chat traffic to the system console.\nEmits per-turn user / agent / tool entries via NSFuckingLog so you can trace exactly what the agent received and produced. Useful for debugging tool dispatch and history translation. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue." = "除錯： 將 AI 對話流量記錄到系統控制台。\n透過 NSFuckingLog 逐輪輸出使用者 / 代理 / 工具項目，讓你可以精確追蹤代理接收和產出的內容。用於除錯工具分發和歷史記錄翻譯。預設關閉；僅在重現問題時開啟。";
"Debugging: Log a detailed trace when a session’s foreground-job ancestor list unexpectedly shrinks.\nWhen an intermediate ancestor (such as the claude CLI) drops out of a tracked session’s foreground-job ancestry for a single process-cache update, log via RLog which pid held the vanished ancestor, whether it is still in the process table, and the full upward walk from the deepest foreground job. Used to diagnose spurious job-ended events that can tear down a Claude Code workgroup. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue." = "除錯： 當工作階段的前台作業祖先列表意外縮小時，記錄詳細的追蹤資訊。\n當中間祖先（如 claude CLI）在某次行程快取更新中從被追蹤工作階段的前台作業譜系中消失時，透過 RLog 記錄是哪個 pid 持有該消失的祖先、它是否仍在行程表中，以及從最深前台作業開始的完整向上遍歷。用於診斷可能導致 Claude Code 工作群組被拆除的虛假作業結束事件。預設關閉；僅在重現問題時開啟。";
"Debugging: Log raw AI API requests and responses to disk.\nWrites every byte sent to and received from the AI vendor (full request headers, body, streaming chunks, final response, errors, and timing) to ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/AIChatWire/. One log file per app launch; rotate or delete it yourself when done. WARNING: the log captures Authorization / API-key headers and full prompt + response content verbatim. Off by default; turn on only while reproducing an issue and delete the files when finished." = "除錯： 將原始 AI API 請求和回應記錄到磁碟。\n將傳送給和接收自 AI 供應商的每一個位元組（完整請求標頭、內容、串流分塊、最終回應、錯誤和耗時）寫入 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/AIChatWire/。每次啟動應用程式產生一個日誌檔案；完成後請自行輪轉或刪除。警告：日誌會逐字記錄 Authorization / API 金鑰標頭以及完整的提示詞和回應內容。預設關閉；僅在重現問題時開啟，並在完成後刪除這些檔案。";
"Debugging: Log restorable state size info to /tmp/statesize.*.txt." = "除錯： 將可復原狀態的大小資訊記錄到 /tmp/statesize.*.txt。";
"Debugging: Log stats about text drawing performance to console.\nUsed for performance testing." = "除錯： 將文字繪製效能統計記錄到控制台。\n用於效能測試。";
"Debugging: Outline dirty rects in the legacy renderer with random colors.\nUseful for visually verifying which regions of the text view are being repainted each frame. This affects only the legacy (non-GPU) renderer and does nothing when the GPU (Metal) renderer is active, so it is not a way to tell whether the GPU renderer is engaged. To use it, first turn off the GPU renderer in Settings → General → Magic." = "除錯： 用隨機顏色勾勒傳統繪製器的髒矩形。\n用於直觀驗證文字視圖每一幀重繪了哪些區域。這僅影響傳統（非 GPU）繪製器，在 GPU（Metal）繪製器啟用時無效，因此不能用來判斷 GPU 繪製器是否啟用。要使用此功能，請先在「設定 → 一般 → Magic」中關閉 GPU 繪製器。";
"Debugging: Override the local hostname used for localhost detection.\nWhen non-empty, the app behaves as though [NSHost fullyQualifiedDomainName] returns this value. Lets you test how localhost detection reacts to a hostname change without actually renaming your computer. Affects hosts reported after you change it; leave empty to use the real hostname." = "除錯： 覆寫用於 localhost 偵測的本地主機名。\n非空時，應用程式會表現得如同 [NSHost fullyQualifiedDomainName] 回傳此值。讓你無需實際重新命名電腦即可測試 localhost 偵測對主機名變更的反應。更改後會影響回報的主機名；留空則使用真實主機名。";
"Debugging: Show line buffer block boundaries (issue 6207)" = "除錯： 顯示行緩衝區塊邊界（issue 6207）";
"Debugging: Start debug logging automatically when iTerm2 is launched." = "除錯： iTerm2 啟動時自動開始除錯日誌。";
"Decrease Height" = "縮小高度";
"Decrease Width" = "縮小寬度";
"DeepSeek" = "DeepSeek";
"Default model for new AI chats" = "新 AI 對話的預設模型";
"Default text color" = "預設文字顏色";
"Default text color in dark mode" = "預設文字顏色（深色模式）";
"Default text color in light mode" = "預設文字顏色（明亮模式）";
"Delete" = "刪除";
"Delete profile %@?" = "刪除設定檔 %@？";
"Directory for archived sessions" = "已封存工作階段目錄";
"Directory for automatic logging files" = "自動日誌檔目錄";
"Disable Loading from URL" = "停用從 URL 載入";
"Disabled" = "停用";
"Discard Local Changes" = "捨棄本機變更";
"Do Not Remap Modifiers" = "不重新對映修飾鍵";
"Don’t Copy" = "不複製";
"Don’t Load Remote Settings" = "不載入遠端設定";
"Dot:" = "點：";
"Drawing: Allow HDR effects\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 may render some UI effects, such as the selected tab's outline, brighter than white on an HDR-capable display. Off by default because forcing the display into extended dynamic range can cause hangs on some systems." = "繪製： 允許 HDR 效果\n啟用後，iTerm2 可能會在支援 HDR 的顯示器上將某些 UI 效果（如選中分頁的輪廓）繪製得比白色更亮。預設關閉，因為強制顯示器進入擴展動態範圍可能導致某些系統卡頓。";
"Drawing: Alpha value for shade that covers areas outside the currently selected command." = "繪製： 覆蓋當前選中指令之外區域的遮罩 alpha 值。";
"Drawing: Always use line-style marks?" = "繪製： 始終使用線條樣式標記？";
"Drawing: Animate graph-based status bar components?\nTurn this off to reduce CPU/GPU usage in WindowServer." = "繪製： 為基於圖表的狀態列元件新增動畫？\n關閉此項可降低 WindowServer 的 CPU/GPU 使用率。";
"Drawing: Disable adaptive framerate in interactive apps.\nTurn off adaptive frame rate while in alternate screen mode for more consistent refresh rate. This works even if alternate screen mode is disabled." = "繪製： 在互動式應用中停用自適應幀率。\n在備用螢幕模式下關閉自適應幀率以獲得更一致的重新整理率。即使停用了備用螢幕模式，此設定也有效。";
"Drawing: Disable indicator icons that appear in the top right of a session?\nThis includes the following indicators: maximized pane, broadcast input, coprocess running, alert on next mark, output suppression, zoom, copy mode, and debug logging." = "繪製： 停用工作階段右上角出現的指示器圖示？\n這包括以下指示器：最大化分割窗格、廣播輸入、協同程序執行中、下次標記提醒、輸出抑制、縮放、複製模式以及除錯日誌。";
"Drawing: Draw certain Powerline symbols double-width?\nThis matches how most “nerd” fonts render them, but your favorite one might not do this. An example code point that is affected is U+E0B8." = "繪製： 將某些 Powerline 符號繪製為雙寬？\n這匹配大多數「nerd」字型的繪製方式，但您喜歡的字型可能不這樣做。受影響的示例碼位是 U+E0B8。";
"Drawing: Draw outline around underline and vertical bar cursors using background color." = "繪製： 使用背景顏色為底線和豎條游標繪製輪廓。";
"Drawing: Duration in seconds for smooth cursor slide animation.\nThis affects the \"Smooth slide\" cursor movement option." = "繪製： 平滑游標滑動動畫的時長（秒）。\n這影響「平滑滑動」游標移動選項。";
"Drawing: Duration in seconds for the “Animate large movements” cursor animation." = "繪製： 「大移動量動畫」游標動畫的時長（秒）。";
"Drawing: Enable cache of double-width character locations?\nThis should improve performance. It is always on in nightly builds. You must restart iTerm2 for this setting to take effect." = "繪製： 啟用雙寬字元位置快取？\n這應能提升效能。在 nightly 建置中始終開啟。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Drawing: Enable contextual alternates (calt) for ligature-capable fonts.\nWhen enabled, uses ligature level 2 which activates calt in addition to standard ligatures. Many coding fonts such as Monaspace, Iosevka, and Cascadia Code require this for their ligatures to work." = "繪製： 為支援連字的字型啟用上下文備選 (calt)。\n啟用後，使用連字級別 2，除了標準連字外還啟用 calt。許多程式設計字型（如 Monaspace、Iosevka 和 Cascadia Code）需要此功能才能使其連字生效。";
"Drawing: Force text to be anti-aliased on Retina displays.\nEnable this to use non-AA text on non-retina displays, which sometimes looks better." = "繪製： 在 Retina 顯示器上強制文字抗鋸齒。\n啟用此項可在非 Retina 顯示器上使用非抗鋸齒文字，有時看起來更好。";
"Drawing: Frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is enabled and throughput is low but not 0." = "繪製： 啟用自適應幀率且吞吐量較低但非 0 時的幀率（FPS）。";
"Drawing: GPU renderer redraws at least this often, in seconds.\nThis is to work around a problem where the GPU renderer encounters a lot of latency when drawing for the first time after a short period of inactivity. Set this to a big number to render it ineffectual." = "繪製： GPU 渲染器至少以此頻率重繪（秒）。\n這是為了解決 GPU 渲染器在短暫不活動後首次繪製時遇到大量延遲的問題。將此值設為一個較大的數字可使其失效。";
"Drawing: HDR cursor\nExperimental. Half-baked. Probably don't use this." = "繪製： HDR 游標\n實驗性功能。尚未完善。建議不要使用。";
"Drawing: Improves drawing performance at the expense of disallowing alphanumeric characters to belong to ligatures." = "繪製： 以不允許字母數字字元屬於連字為代價提升繪製效能。";
"Drawing: Include extended symbols when drawing Powerline natively." = "繪製： 原生繪製 Powerline 時包含擴展符號。";
"Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when adaptive framerate is disabled.\nNote: this is doubled on ARM Macs for displays that support at least 120hz. Modifications to this setting will not affect existing sessions." = "繪製： 停用自適應幀率時的最大幀率（FPS）。\n注意：在支援至少 120hz 的顯示器上，ARM Mac 上此值翻倍。修改此設定不會影響現有工作階段。";
"Drawing: Maximum frame rate (FPS) when low power mode is enabled." = "繪製： 啟用低電量模式時的最大幀率（FPS）。";
"Drawing: Maximum horizontal distance in cells for smooth cursor slide animation.\nCursor movements larger than this will not animate." = "繪製： 平滑游標滑動動畫的最大水平距離（儲存格）。\n大於此值的游標移動不會產生動畫。";
"Drawing: Metal renderer uses integrated GPU when not connected to power?\nFor this to be effective you must disable “Disable Metal renderer when not connected to power”." = "繪製： 未連接電源時 Metal 渲染器使用整合式 GPU？\n要使其生效，您必須停用「未連接電源時停用 Metal 渲染器」。";
"Drawing: Minimum weight difference between regular and bold font.\nThis affects selection of the bold version of a font. Font weights go from 0 to 9. If no font can be found that has a high enough weight then the regular font will be double-struck with a small offset." = "繪製： 常規字型與粗體之間的最小字重差異。\n這影響字型粗體版本的選擇。字型字重從 0 到 9。如果找不到字重足夠高的字型，則常規字型將以小偏移雙重描邊。";
"Drawing: Path to CSS file to customize native drawing (for dark background colors)." = "繪製： 用於自訂原生繪製的 CSS 檔案路徑（用於深色背景顏色）。";
"Drawing: Path to CSS file to customize native drawing (for light background colors)." = "繪製： 用於自訂原生繪製的 CSS 檔案路徑（用於淺色背景顏色）。";
"Drawing: Prefer speed to accuracy for characters with combining marks?" = "繪製： 對於帶組合標記的字元，優先速度而非精度？";
"Drawing: Show FPS meter\nRequires Metal renderer" = "繪製： 顯示 FPS 計量表\n需要 Metal 渲染器";
"Drawing: Show URL preview on cmd-hover for semantic history matches." = "繪製： 在按住 ⌘ 悬停時為語意歷史匹配顯示 URL 預覽。";
"Drawing: Thickness of underline cursor." = "繪製： 底線游標的粗細。";
"Drawing: Throughput threshold for adaptive frame rate.\nIf more than this many bytes per second are received, use the lower frame rate of 30 fps." = "繪製： 自適應幀率的吞吐量閾值。\n如果每秒接收的位元組數超過此值，則使用較低的 30 fps 幀率。";
"Drawing: Underline OSC 8 hyperlinks" = "繪製： 為 OSC 8 超連結新增底線。";
"Drawing: Use GCD-based update timer instead of NSTimer.\nThis should cause more regular screen updates. Restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "繪製： 使用基於 GCD 的更新計時器而非 NSTimer。\n這應能使螢幕更新更規律。更改此設定後重啟 iTerm2。";
"Drawing: Use adaptive framerate.\nWhen throughput is low, the screen will update at 60 frames per second. When throughput is higher, it will drop to a configurable rate (15 fps by default)." = "繪製： 使用自適應幀率。\n當吞吐量較低時，螢幕以每秒 60 幀更新。當吞吐量較高時，會降至可設定的速率（預設 15 fps）。";
"Drawing: Use multi-pass underline renderer?\nFixes underline gaps with ligature fonts. Requires restart." = "繪製： 使用多遍底線渲染器？\n修復連字字型的底線間隙。需要重啟。";
"Drawing: Use solid underlines?\nWhen disabled, underlines break near text that would intersect them." = "繪製： 使用實線底線？\n停用後，底線在與文字相交處斷開。";
"Drawing: Use your typeface’s box-drawing characters instead of iTerm2’s custom drawing code.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "繪製： 使用您字型的製表字元而非 iTerm2 的自訂繪製程式碼。\n更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2。";
"Drawing: Use zippy text drawing algorithm?\nThis draws non-ASCII text more quickly but with lower fidelity. This setting is ignored if ligatures are enabled in Settings > Profiles > Text." = "繪製： 使用快速文字繪製演算法？\n此演算法繪製非 ASCII 文字速度更快但保真度較低。如果在「設定 > 設定檔 > 文字」中啟用了連字，此設定將被忽略。";
"Drawing: When adaptive framerate is enabled and using the Metal renderer, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS)." = "繪製： 啟用自適應幀率並使用 Metal 渲染器時，在高吞吐量條件下以此速率重新整理（FPS）。";
"Drawing: When adaptive framerate is enabled, refresh at this rate during high throughput conditions (FPS).\n Does not apply to Metal renderer." = "繪製： 啟用自適應幀率時，在高吞吐量條件下以此速率重新整理（FPS）。\n不適用於 Metal 渲染器。";
"Drawing: When animated cursor movement is enabled, only perform animation if the cursor moves at least this distance in points." = "繪製： 啟用游標移動動畫時，僅當游標移動距離至少為此值（點）時才執行動畫。";
"Duplicate" = "建立副本";
"Duplicate Tab" = "建立分頁副本";
"Duration in seconds for the cursor to fade in when smooth blink is enabled" = "啟用平滑閃爍時游標淡入的持續時間（秒）";
"Duration in seconds for the cursor to fade out when smooth blink is enabled" = "啟用平滑閃爍時游標淡出的持續時間（秒）";
"Easing curve for the cursor fade-in (0=linear, 1=ease in, 2=ease out, 3=ease in-out)" = "游標淡入的緩動曲線（0=線性，1=緩入，2=緩出，3=緩入緩出）";
"Easing curve for the cursor fade-out (0=linear, 1=ease in, 2=ease out, 3=ease in-out)" = "游標淡出的緩動曲線（0=線性，1=緩入，2=緩出，3=緩入緩出）";
"Economy model" = "經濟型模型";
"Edit" = "編輯";
"Edit Manual AI Model" = "編輯手動 AI 模型";
"Edit Session" = "編輯工作階段";
"Empty Default" = "清空預設值";
"Emulate US Keyboard" = "模擬美式鍵盤";
"Enabled" = "啟用";
"Endpoint" = "端點";
"Enter URL" = "輸入 URL";
"Enter URL." = "輸入 URL。";
"Enter a header name and value. The name is required." = "請輸入標頭名稱和值。名稱為必填項。";
"Enter a model name and URL before testing the connection." = "測試連線前請輸入模型名稱和 URL。";
"Enter command" = "輸入命令";
"Enter command to run" = "輸入要執行的命令";
"Enter coprocess command" = "輸入協同行程命令";
"Enter file name" = "輸入檔案名稱";
"Enter function invocation" = "輸入函式呼叫";
"Enter interpolated string (evaluated in session context)" = "輸入插值字串（在工作階段情境中求值）";
"Enter name of menu item" = "輸入選單項目名稱";
"Enter text" = "輸入文字";
"Enter tmux command" = "輸入 tmux 命令";
"Enter value to send" = "輸入要傳送的值";
"Enter value to send. Click help button for special characters." = "輸入要傳送的值。點擊說明按鈕查看特殊字元。";
"Error" = "錯誤";
"Error Loading Settings" = "載入設定時發生錯誤";
"Error saving to %@: %@" = "儲存到 %@ 時發生錯誤：%@";
"Esc +" = "Esc +";
"Esc+" = "Esc+";
"Escaping" = "跳脫";
"Exclude From Dock and App Switcher" = "從 Dock 和應用程式切換器中排除";
"Experimental Features: AI model name substrings that use the modern 'completions' API.\nSubstrings should be space-delimited. This handles OpenRouter-style names like 'openai/gpt-4o'. Note that o1 models use a different API and have hard-coded behavior." = "實驗性功能： 使用現代 'completions' API 的 AI 模型名稱子字串。\n子字串應以空格分隔。這處理 OpenRouter 風格的名稱，如 'openai/gpt-4o'。注意 o1 模型使用不同的 API，行為已硬編碼。";
"Experimental Features: Add path to iTerm2 utilities to $PATH for new sessions?" = "實驗性功能： 為新工作階段將 iTerm2 公用工具路徑新增到 $PATH？";
"Experimental Features: After this many commands, make codecierge confirm that you intend to keep it enabled." = "實驗性功能： 執行這麼多命令後，讓 codecierge 確認你打算保持其啟用。";
"Experimental Features: Aggressively keep windows on the screen they were configured to be on" = "實驗性功能： 強制將視窗保留在設定時所在的螢幕上";
"Experimental Features: Allow function keys to be handled by macOS text input system.\nThis supports using function keys with modifiers as compose/dead keys in custom keyboard layouts." = "實驗性功能： 允許功能鍵由 macOS 文字輸入系統處理。\n這支援在自訂鍵盤佈局中將帶修飾鍵的功能鍵用作組合鍵/死鍵。";
"Experimental Features: Allow variable window sizes in tmux integration.\nRequres tmux version 2.9 or later." = "實驗性功能： 在 tmux 整合中允許可變視窗大小。\n需要 tmux 2.9 或更高版本。";
"Experimental Features: Auto-detect paragraph writing direction based on the first strong directional character?\nRequires right-to-left text support to be enabled." = "實驗性功能： 根據第一個強方向字元自動偵測段落書寫方向？\n需要啟用從右到左文字支援。";
"Experimental Features: Automatically restore keyboard mode when an ssh session ends?" = "實驗性功能： ssh 工作階段結束時自動復原鍵盤模式？";
"Experimental Features: Automatically search for selected text after making a selection?" = "實驗性功能： 進行選取後自動搜尋選取的文字？";
"Experimental Features: Cache per-row GPU build output?\nSkips rebuilding the glyph and color data for rows whose content and configuration have not changed since the last frame. Experimental." = "實驗性功能： 快取逐行 GPU 建置輸出？\n跳過對自上一幀以來內容和設定未更改的行重建字形和顏色資料。實驗性功能。";
"Experimental Features: Clear bell icon when a session becomes active.\nWhen off, you must type in the session to clear the bell icon." = "實驗性功能： 工作階段變為活躍時清除響鈴圖示。\n關閉時，你必須在工作階段中輸入才能清除響鈴圖示。";
"Experimental Features: Detect base unicode characters with lookup table.\nApple's algorithm for segmenting composed characters makes bad choices, such as for Tamil. Enable this to reduce text overlapping." = "實驗性功能： 使用查找表偵測基礎 Unicode 字元。\nApple 的組合字元分割演算法會做出糟糕的選擇，例如對泰米爾語。啟用此項可減少文字重疊。";
"Experimental Features: Disable metal renderer when idle to save CPU utilization?\nRequires Metal renderer" = "實驗性功能： 閒置時停用 Metal 繪製器以節省 CPU 使用率？\n需要 Metal 繪製器";
"Experimental Features: Disclaim ownership of children.\nBy enabling this, when launching a Cocoa app from a terminal window TCC should attribute ownership to the app, not iTerm2, for permissions. In order for changes to this setting to take effect, you must kill iTermServer." = "實驗性功能： 放棄子行程的所有權。\n啟用此項後，從終端視窗啟動 Cocoa 應用時，TCC 應將權限所有權歸於該應用而非 iTerm2。要使此設定的更改生效，你必須終止 iTermServer。";
"Experimental Features: Dismember scroll view for better GPU performance?\nThis enables a dangerous hack that might improve drawing performance on macOS 10.14 only." = "實驗性功能： 拆分捲動視圖以獲得更好的 GPU 效能？\n這會啟用一個危險的 hack，可能僅在 macOS 10.14 上提升繪製效能。";
"Experimental Features: Enable AquaSKK bugfix?" = "實驗性功能： 啟用 AquaSKK bug 修復？";
"Experimental Features: Enable Channels feature?" = "實驗性功能： 啟用 Channels 功能？";
"Experimental Features: Enable browser-style profiles?\nYou must restart iTerm2 for this to take effect." = "實驗性功能： 啟用瀏覽器風格的設定檔？\n你必須重啟 iTerm2 此設定才能生效。";
"Experimental Features: Enable character accent menu.\nThis disables the ordinary key repeat behavior for press-and-hold. You must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect." = "實驗性功能： 啟用字元重音選單。\n這會停用按住的普通按鍵重複行為。你必須重啟 iTerm2 此更改才會生效。";
"Experimental Features: Enable low-latency updates of the current foreground job" = "實驗性功能： 啟用目前前台作業的低延遲更新";
"Experimental Features: Enable more compact logging when using auto composer?\nThis will avoid logging raw data in your prompt and your interactions with it. Instead, the prompt is logged once in plain text and the command is logged when sent." = "實驗性功能： 使用自動編輯器時啟用更緊湊的日誌？\n這將避免記錄提示詞和與其互動的原始資料。取而代之，提示詞以純文字記錄一次，命令在傳送時記錄。";
"Experimental Features: Enable multi-server daemon.\nA new implementation of session restoration that combines daemon processes." = "實驗性功能： 啟用多伺服器常駐程式。\n工作階段復原的新實作，合併了常駐程式。";
"Experimental Features: Enable restorable state controller?\nThis makes window restoration more reliable." = "實驗性功能： 啟用可復原狀態控制器？\n這使視窗復原更可靠。";
"Experimental Features: Enable support for REP (Repeat previous character) escape sequence?" = "實驗性功能： 啟用對 REP（重複上一個字元）轉義序列的支援？";
"Experimental Features: Escape file names with single quotes instead of backslashes.\nThis is intended for users of xonsh, which does not accept backslash escaping." = "實驗性功能： 用單引號而不是反斜線轉義檔名。\n這面向 xonsh 使用者，xonsh 不接受反斜線轉義。";
"Experimental Features: Extend background color into margins in alternate screen mode?" = "實驗性功能： 在備用螢幕模式下將背景顏色延伸到邊距？";
"Experimental Features: Fast regular expression evaluation for triggers.\nThis is experimental because it could potentially change how regular expressions are interpreted." = "實驗性功能： 觸發器的快速正規表示式求值。\n這是實驗性的，因為它可能改變正規表示式的解釋方式。";
"Experimental Features: Lone regional indicators render full-width.\nA complete flag is always two columns, which is the width wcwidth reports for the pair." = "實驗性功能： 孤立地區指示符全寬繪製。\n完整的國旗始終為兩列，即 wcwidth 對該組合報告的寬度。";
"Experimental Features: Host and port for proxy for AI requests.\ni.e., example.com:8080" = "實驗性功能： AI 請求代理的主機和連接埠。\n例如 example.com：8080";
"Experimental Features: Improved support for input method editors like AquaSKK." = "實驗性功能： 改進對 AquaSKK 等輸入法編輯器的支援。";
"Experimental Features: Kill sessions on logout.\nA possible fix for issue 4147." = "實驗性功能： 登出時終止工作階段。\n可能是 issue 4147 的修復方案。";
"Experimental Features: List of fonts to use alternate rounding algorithm for line height calculation.\nThis fixes consolas and emulates Terminal.app’s behavior on macOS 10.15. This is a comma-delimited list of font family substrings." = "實驗性功能： 使用備用捨入演算法計算行高的字型列表。\n這修復了 consolas 並模擬 Terminal.app 在 macOS 10.15 上的行為。這是以逗號分隔的字型族子字串列表。";
"Experimental Features: Log a histogram of non-ASCII string lengths periodically.\nUseful for tuning the async pre-conversion minimum string length." = "實驗性功能： 定期記錄非 ASCII 字串長度的直方圖。\n用於調優非同步預轉換的最小字串長度。";
"Experimental Features: Make the tab bar a titlebar accessory view in Big Sur?" = "實驗性功能： 在 Big Sur 中將分頁列設為標題列附件檢視？";
"Experimental Features: Make uploads with it2ul really fast." = "實驗性功能： 讓使用 it2ul 的上傳非常快。";
"Experimental Features: Maximum bytes of outstanding async pre-conversions.\nWhen this limit is reached, new strings are converted synchronously on the mutation thread." = "實驗性功能： 未完成的非同步預轉換的最大位元組數。\n達到此限制時，新字串在變更執行緒上同步轉換。";
"Experimental Features: Minimum string length (in UTF-16 code units) to dispatch for async pre-conversion." = "實驗性功能： 分派給非同步預轉換的最小字串長度（以 UTF-16 碼元為單位）。";
"Experimental Features: Mouse wheel always scrolls when scroll bars are visible" = "實驗性功能： 捲軸可見時滑鼠滾輪始終捲動";
"Experimental Features: Post fake flags-changed events when remapping modifiers with an event tap.\nThis is an attempt to work around incompatibilities with AltTab in issue 10220." = "實驗性功能： 使用事件點選重映射修飾鍵時傳送虛假的 flags-changed 事件。\n這是嘗試規避 issue 10220 中與 AltTab 的不相容問題。";
"Experimental Features: Pre-convert long non-ASCII strings on a background queue.\nThis decouples preconversion from the parser thread for better throughput." = "實驗性功能： 在背景佇列上預轉換長的非 ASCII 字串。\n這將預轉換與解析器執行緒解耦，以獲得更好的吞吐量。";
"Experimental Features: Pre-convert non-ASCII strings to screen characters on the parser thread.\nThis exploits parallelism between parsing and screen mutation for better performance." = "實驗性功能： 在解析器執行緒上將非 ASCII 字串預轉換為螢幕字元。\n這利用了解析和螢幕變更之間的平行性以獲得更好的效能。";
"Experimental Features: Prompt to send to LLM for Codecierge when it is NOT able to execute commands automatically.\n$GOAL and $CONTEXT are replaced with the user-specified goal and info about the running environment, respectively." = "實驗性功能： Codecierge 不能自動執行命令時傳送給 LLM 的提示詞。\n$GOAL 和 $CONTEXT 分別替換為使用者指定的目標和執行環境的資訊。";
"Experimental Features: Prompt to send to LLM for Codecierge when it is able to execute commands automatically.\n$GOAL and $CONTEXT are replaced with the user-specified goal and info about the running environment, respectively." = "實驗性功能： Codecierge 能夠自動執行命令時傳送給 LLM 的提示詞。\n$GOAL 和 $CONTEXT 分別替換為使用者指定的目標和執行環境的資訊。";
"Experimental Features: Reduce number of frames in flight when GPU can't produce drawables quickly." = "實驗性功能： 當 GPU 無法快速生成 drawable 時減少飛行中的幀數。";
"Experimental Features: Report 16-bit color values to OSC 4 and 10 through 19.\nWorks around a bug in older vim where they could not properly parse 8-bit values." = "實驗性功能： 向 OSC 4 和 10 到 19 回報 16 位元顏色值。\n規避舊版 vim 無法正確解析 8 位元值的 bug。";
"Experimental Features: Report multiple mouse scroll events when scrolling quickly?" = "實驗性功能： 快速捲動時回報多個滑鼠捲動事件？";
"Experimental Features: Reset colors at shell prompt?\nUses shell integration to detect a shell prompt and, if enabled, resets colors to their defaults." = "實驗性功能： 在 shell 提示符處重置顏色？\n使用 shell integration 偵測 shell 提示符，並在啟用時將顏色重置為預設值。";
"Experimental Features: Right-justify lines in paragraphs with base writing direction of right-to-left?\nRequires BOTH “right-to-left text support” and “auto-detect paragraph writing detection” to be enabled." = "實驗性功能： 在基礎書寫方向為從右到左的段落中將行右對齊？\n需要同時啟用「從右到左文字支援」和「自動偵測段落書寫方向」。";
"Experimental Features: SSH URLs respect the path.\nThey run the command: ssh -t \"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\$SHELL -l\"" = "實驗性功能： SSH URL 遵循路徑。\n它們執行命令：ssh -t \"cd $$PATH$$； exec \\$SHELL -l\"";
"Experimental Features: Save unlimited amount of window contents.\nThis is going to be slow unless you enable SQLite-based window restoration too." = "實驗性功能： 儲存無限量的視窗內容。\n除非你也啟用基於 SQLite 的視窗復原，否則這會很慢。";
"Experimental Features: Set LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2.\nopenssh and mosh pass this to hosts you connect to. It communicates the current terminal emulator. This is useful for enabling terminal emulator-specific features." = "實驗性功能： 設定 LC_TERMINAL=iTerm2。\nopenssh 和 mosh 會將此傳遞給你連接的主機。它傳達目前終端模擬器。這對啟用終端模擬器特定功能很有用。";
"Experimental Features: Show inline images at Retina resolution." = "實驗性功能： 以 Retina 解析度顯示內聯影像。";
"Experimental Features: Show prompt locations in scroll bar?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart. You must also enable “Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar” for this to take effect." = "實驗性功能： 在捲軸中顯示提示符位置？\n更改此設定在重啟前不會影響現有工作階段。你還必須啟用「在捲軸中顯示搜尋結果和提示符位置」此項才能生效。";
"Experimental Features: Show search result and prompt locations in scroll bar.\nChanging this setting will not affect existing sessions until you restart." = "實驗性功能： 在捲軸中顯示搜尋結果和提示符位置。\n更改此設定在重啟前不會影響現有工作階段。";
"Experimental Features: Stamp frame numbers into the iTerm2 Buddy live stream?\nDraws a monotonic counter onto each streamed video frame, for debugging the phone’s live session view." = "實驗性功能： 在 iTerm2 Buddy 即時串流中蓋印幀編號？\n在每個串流視訊幀上繪製單調遞增計數器，用於除錯手機的即時工作階段檢視。";
"Experimental Features: Store window restoration state in SQLite" = "實驗性功能： 將視窗復原狀態儲存在 SQLite 中";
"Experimental Features: Support DECSET 1036?\nThis allows apps in the terminal to control whether the option key sends esc+ or acts like a regular option key." = "實驗性功能： 支援 DECSET 1036？\n這允許終端中的應用控制 option 鍵是傳送 esc+ 還是作為普通 option 鍵。";
"Experimental Features: Support modifier remapping for keystrokes originated by Synergy." = "實驗性功能： 支援對 Synergy 發起的按鍵進行修飾鍵重新映射。";
"Experimental Features: Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth in all modes?" = "實驗性功能： 支援變體選擇符 16 在所有模式下使 emoji 全寬？";
"Experimental Features: Support variation selector 16 making emoji fullwidth outside of alternate screen mode?" = "實驗性功能： 支援變體選擇符 16 在備用螢幕模式之外使 emoji 全寬？";
"Experimental Features: Trackpad scrolls fast?\nSet to No for legacy scrolling speed." = "實驗性功能： 觸控式軌跡板快速捲動？\n設為「否」以使用舊版捲動速度。";
"Experimental Features: Treat the equals sign on the numeric keypad as a key on the numeric keypad.\nFor mysterious reasons, macOS does not treat this key as belonging to the numeric keypad. Enable this setting to work around the bug." = "實驗性功能： 將數字小鍵盤上的等號視為數字小鍵盤上的鍵。\n出於神秘原因，macOS 不將該鍵視為屬於數字小鍵盤。啟用此設定可規避該 bug。";
"Experimental Features: Use a more theoretically correct technique to measure line height.\nYou must restart iTerm2 or adjust a session's font size for this change to take effect." = "實驗性功能： 使用理論上更正確的方法來測量行高。\n你必須重啟 iTerm2 或調整工作階段的字型大小此更改才會生效。";
"Experimental Features: Use modern scroll wheel accumulator.\nThis should support wheel mice better and feel more natural." = "實驗性功能： 使用現代滾輪累加器。\n這應能更好地支援滾輪滑鼠並感覺更自然。";
"Experimental Features: Use synchronized Metal drawable presentation?\nDefers drawable acquisition until rendering completes, presents synchronously with Core Animation, and acquires drawables on the private render queue. May improve frame rates." = "實驗性功能： 使用同步的 Metal drawable 呈現？\n將 drawable 獲取延遲到繪製完成，與 Core Animation 同步呈現，並在私有繪製佇列上獲取 drawable。可能提升幀率。";
"Experimental Features: When right-to-left text support is enabled, also support it in alternate screen mode?" = "實驗性功能： 啟用從右到左文字支援時，在備用螢幕模式下也支援？";
"Experimental Features: When splitting a pane, use the profile with local modifications, not the backing profile." = "實驗性功能： 分割分割窗格時，使用帶有本地修改的設定檔，而非底層設定檔。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum capture-time lead, in milliseconds.\nThe host stops sending new frames once it is more than this far ahead of the last frame the phone acknowledged, then resumes when the phone catches up. Larger values tolerate more link latency at the cost of a live view that can lag further behind. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "實驗性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 即時串流：最大擷取時間領先量（以毫秒為單位）。\n當主機領先手機最後確認的幀超過此值時，主機停止傳送新幀，待手機追上後恢復。較大的值能容忍更高的鏈路延遲，代價是即時檢視可能落後更多。僅影響幀率；每幀品質不變。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: maximum phone decode-queue depth.\nThe host stops sending new frames once the phone reports more than this many frames queued for decode/display, then resumes as the queue drains. Larger values let more frames pile up on the phone before backing off. Only the frame rate is affected; per-frame quality is unchanged." = "實驗性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 即時串流：最大手機解碼佇列深度。\n當手機回報排隊等待解碼/顯示的幀超過此值時，主機停止傳送新幀，隨佇列排空而恢復。較大的值允許更多幀在手機上堆疊後再退讓。僅影響幀率；每幀品質不變。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy live stream: video bitrate multiplier.\nScales the resolution-derived encoder bitrate. Values above 1 make streamed text sharper at the cost of bandwidth; values below 1 save bandwidth at the cost of sharpness. The result is still clamped to the stream’s minimum and ceiling bitrates." = "實驗性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 即時串流：視訊位元率倍數。\n縮放基於解析度導出的編碼器位元率。大於 1 的值以頻寬為代價使串流文字更清晰；小於 1 的值以清晰度為代價節省頻寬。結果仍會被限制在串流的最小和最高位元率之間。";
"Experimental Features: iTerm2 Buddy push notifications: minimum seconds between wakeup pushes.\nA wakeup push tells the paired phone to fetch every new message and alert at once, so several in quick succession are wasteful and can leave a later one with nothing to show (the generic “Your agent has an update.” placeholder). The host sends the first wakeup immediately, then coalesces any that follow within this interval into a single trailing wakeup. Lower values notify sooner but coalesce less; higher values coalesce bursts more aggressively." = "實驗性功能： iTerm2 Buddy 推送通知：喚醒推送之間的最小間隔秒數。\n喚醒推送通知配對的手機立即取得所有新訊息和提醒，因此快速連續傳送多次會造成浪費，並可能導致後續推送無可顯示內容（通用的「你的代理有更新。」佔位符）。主機會立即傳送第一次喚醒，然後將此間隔內的後續喚醒合併為一次尾部喚醒。較低的值通知更快但合併較少；較高的值更積極地合併突發推送。";
"Export Failed" = "匯出失敗";
"Export to File" = "匯出至檔案";
"Export…" = "匯出…";
"Extend Selection" = "擴展選取範圍";
"Failed to copy settings to custom directory." = "複製設定到自訂目錄失敗。";
"Failed to load settings from URL. Falling back to local copy." = "從 URL 載入設定失敗。退回本機副本。";
"Failed to load settings from custom directory. Falling back to local copy." = "從自訂目錄載入設定失敗。退回本機副本。";
"File:" = "檔案：";
"Find Again Down" = "向下再次尋找";
"Find Again Up" = "向上再次尋找";
"Find Regular Expression…" = "尋找正規表示式…";
"Focused window" = "目前焦點視窗";
"Force Touch Single Click" = "用力單擊";
"Function Call" = "函式呼叫";
"Function calling" = "函式呼叫";
"Function key behavior: Regular, Hyper, Meta, or Super" = "功能鍵行為：Regular、Hyper、Meta 或 Super";
"Gemini" = "Gemini";
"General" = "一般";
"General: $PATH used when running git for the status bar component.\nChange this to use a custom install of git. You must restart iTerm2 for a change here to take effect." = "一般： 狀態列元件執行 git 時使用的 $PATH。\n更改此項可使用自訂安裝的 git。更改此處後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: 1Password account name.\nThis is used if you’ve enabled the 1Password integration in the password manager. Use `op account list` to get the list of accounts. This can be an account shorthand, sign-in address, account ID, or user ID." = "一般： 1Password 帳戶名稱。\n如果您在密碼管理器中啟用了 1Password 整合，則使用此項。使用 `op account list` 取得帳戶列表。這可以是帳戶簡寫、登入地址、帳戶 ID 或使用者 ID。";
"General: Add a 'Dynamic' tag to dynamic profiles.\nWhen enabled, dynamic profiles will have a 'Dynamic' tag added to them, which can be used to filter or identify them." = "一般： 為動態設定檔新增「Dynamic」標籤。\n啟用後，動態設定檔將新增「Dynamic」標籤，可用於過濾或識別它們。";
"General: Add status bar icon when excluded from dock?\nWhen you turn on “Exclude from Dock and ⌘-Tab Application Switcher” a status bar icon is added to the menu bar so you can switch the setting back off. Disable this to remove the status bar icon. Doing so makes it very hard to get to Settings. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "一般： 從 Dock 中排除時新增狀態列圖示？\n當您開啟「從 Dock 和 ⌘-Tab 應用切換器中排除」時，會在選單列中新增狀態列圖示以便您將該設定重新關閉。停用此項可移除狀態列圖示。這樣做會使進入設定變得非常困難。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2。";
"General: Allow pairing a companion iOS device?\nOff by default while this feature is in development. When off, the Companion Device Settings menu item is hidden. Managed environments can also use this to disable the feature. The user defaults key is `CompanionPairingAllowed`." = "一般： 允許配對 iOS 伴侶裝置？\n此功能開發期間預設關閉。關閉時，「伴侶裝置設定」選單項目被隱藏。受管環境也可用此項停用該功能。使用者預設鍵為 `CompanionPairingAllowed`。";
"General: Allow the standard system menu on window Zoom buttons to open?\nmacOS has a bug that makes the app hang. Since this is a rarely used menu, it is disabled by default." = "一般： 允許視窗縮放按鈕上的標準系統選單開啟？\nmacOS 存在一個會使應用卡住的錯誤。由於此選單很少使用，因此預設停用。";
"General: Allow the use of large language model APIs?\nThe purpose of this setting is to make it easy for managed environments to disable the use of LLMs. The user defaults key is `GenerativeAIAllowed`." = "一般： 允許使用大語言模型 API？\n此設定的目的是讓受管環境易於停用 LLM。使用者預設鍵為 `GenerativeAIAllowed`。";
"General: Bundle ID of browser to open URLs with.\nLeave empty to use system default." = "一般： 用於開啟 URL 的瀏覽器 Bundle ID。\n留空以使用系統預設值。";
"General: Buttons in modal alerts indicate keyboard shortcuts.\nDo you miss Windows 95? I do." = "一般： 強制回應警告中的按鈕指示鍵盤快捷鍵。\n您懷念 Windows 95 嗎？我懷念。";
"General: Comma-separated list of LastPass groups for the password manager to look in for passwords." = "一般： 密碼管理器在其中查找密碼的 LastPass 群組的逗號分隔列表。";
"General: Command to view man pages.\nUsed when you press the man page button on the touch bar. %@ is replaced with the command. End the command with & to avoid opening an iTerm2 window (e.g., if you're launching an external viewer)." = "一般： 檢視 man 頁面的指令。\n在您按下觸控列上的 man 頁面按鈕時使用。%@ 替換為指令。以 & 結尾指令可避免開啟 iTerm2 視窗（例如啟動外部檢視器時）。";
"General: Delay after changing number of screens/resolution until refresh (seconds).\nThis works around OS bugs where it takes some time after a screen change before it is safe to resize windows." = "一般： 螢幕數量/解析度更改後到重新整理前的延遲（秒）。\n這用於繞過螢幕更改後需要一段時間才能安全調整視窗大小的作業系統錯誤。";
"General: Delay between detecting a change to dynamic profiles and acting on it.\nIf a lot of changes happen to the DynamicProfiles folder a longer delay will help coalesce filesystem events to reduce CPU usage." = "一般： 偵測到動態設定檔更改與執行操作之間的延遲。\n如果 DynamicProfiles 檔案夾發生大量更改，較長的延遲有助於合併檔案系統事件以降低 CPU 使用率。";
"General: Disable App Nap.\nChange effective after restarting iTerm2." = "一般： 停用 App Nap。\n重啟 iTerm2 後生效。";
"General: Disable DECRQCRA?\nThis control sequence allows an app running in the terminal to read its contents." = "一般： 停用 DECRQCRA？\n此控制序列允許在終端中執行的應用讀取其內容。";
"General: Disable potentially insecure escape sequences.\nSome features of iTerm2 expand the surface area for security issues. Consider turning this on when viewing untrusted content. The following custom escape sequences will be disabled: RemoteHost, StealFocus, CurrentDir, SetProfile, CopyToClipboard, EndCopy, File, SetBackgroundImageFile, OSC 6’s proxy icon-changing feature. The following DEC sequences are disabled: DECRQCRA. The following xterm extensions are disabled: Window Title Reporting, Icon Title Reporting. This will break displaying inline images, file download, some shell integration features, and other features." = "一般： 停用潛在不安全的逸出序列。\niTerm2 的某些功能擴大了安全問題的攻擊面。在檢視不受信任的內容時考慮啟用此項。以下自訂逸出序列將被停用：RemoteHost、StealFocus、CurrentDir、SetProfile、CopyToClipboard、EndCopy、File、SetBackgroundImageFile、OSC 6 的代理圖示更改功能。以下 DEC 序列被停用：DECRQCRA。以下 xterm 擴展被停用：視窗標題報告、圖示標題報告。這將破壞內嵌圖像顯示、檔案下載、某些 shell 整合功能及其他功能。";
"General: Disable remapping modifiers for system shortcuts.\nThis prevents asking for accessibility permission. It breaks remapping system shortcuts like cmd-tab." = "一般： 停用系統快捷鍵的修飾鍵重映射。\n這可避免請求輔助功能權限。它會破壞 cmd-tab 等系統快捷鍵的重映射。";
"General: Downloads folder.\nIf set, downloaded files go to this location instead of the user’s $HOME/Downloads folder." = "一般： 下載檔案夾。\n如果設定，下載的檔案將到此位置而非使用者的 $HOME/Downloads 檔案夾。";
"General: Dry-run “Erase All Settings and Data”.\nWhen enabled, the Erase All Settings and Data button logs what it would delete (via NSLog) instead of actually deleting anything, and does not quit. Intended for testing the feature." = "一般： 試執行「擦除所有設定和資料」。\n啟用後，「擦除所有設定和資料」按鈕會透過 NSLog 記錄將要刪除的內容而非實際刪除任何內容，並且不會退出。用於測試此功能。";
"General: Exclude utun interfaces from network utilization?\nThis is useful if you use a VPN and only want to see the traffic that goes over Wi-Fi or Ethernet." = "一般： 從網路利用率中排除 utun 介面？\n如果您使用 VPN 且只想查看透過 Wi-Fi 或乙太網路的流量，此功能很有用。";
"General: Folder for config files. There must not be a space in the path.\nIf empty, then ~/.config/iterm2 will be the default location." = "一般： 設定檔的檔案夾。路徑中不得包含空格。\n如果為空，則 ~/.config/iterm2 將作為預設位置。";
"General: Folder where the “Save” button in the screenshot window writes files.\nLeave empty to save to the Desktop. The “Save As…” button ignores this and always prompts for a location." = "一般： 截圖視窗中「儲存」按鈕寫入檔案的檔案夾。\n留空以儲存到桌面。「另存新檔…」按鈕忽略此項並始終提示選擇位置。";
"General: Grace period for automatic quitting after the last window is closed.\nIf iTerm2 is configured to quit automatically when the last window is closed, this setting gives a grace period (in seconds) after startup where that feature is disabled. Set to 0 to have no grace period." = "一般： 關閉最後一個視窗後自動退出的寬限期。\n如果 iTerm2 設定為在最後一個視窗關閉時自動退出，此設定指定啟動後該功能被停用的寬限期（秒）。設為 0 表示無寬限期。";
"General: Height of the status bar in points.\nThis will also affect the height of per-pane title bars becuase the status bar may be embedded in it. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "一般： 狀態列的高度（點）。\n這也會影響每個分割窗格標題列的高度，因為狀態列可能嵌入其中。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Hide stuck tooltips.\nWhen you hide iTerm2 using a hotkey while a tooltip is fading out it gets stuck because of an OS bug. Work around it with a nasty hack by enabling this feature." = "一般： 隱藏卡住的工具提示。\n當您使用熱鍵隱藏 iTerm2 時，若工具提示正在淡出，由於作業系統錯誤它會卡住。啟用此功能可透過一個棘手的變通方法解決此問題。";
"General: Hotkey windows are excluded from Cycle Through Windows." = "一般： 熱鍵視窗被排除在「循環切換視窗」之外。";
"General: How long to wait for the emoji panel to open in seconds?\nFloating hotkey windows adjust their level when the emoji panel is open. If it’s really slow you might need to increase this value to prevent it from appearing beneath a floating hotkey window." = "一般： 等待表情面板開啟的時長（秒）？\n浮動熱鍵視窗會在表情面板開啟時調整其層級。如果速度很慢，您可能需要增大此值以防止它出現在浮動熱鍵視窗下方。";
"General: Indicate the number of bells rung while the app is inactive in the dock icon’s badge label" = "一般： 在 Dock 圖示的徽章標籤中指示應用處於非活動狀態時響鈴的次數。";
"General: LLM Platform.\nLegal values are: OpenAI, Azure, Gemini. This determines the format of requests and responses." = "一般： LLM 平台。\n合法值為：OpenAI、Azure、Gemini。這決定請求和回應的格式。";
"General: Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Python API.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "一般： 提供給 Python API 的選取範圍最大位元組數。\n此處設定較大值可能會在選取範圍很大時導致效能問題。";
"General: Maximum number of bytes of selection to provide to Services.\nA large value here can cause performance issues when you have a big selection." = "一般： 提供給服務的選取範圍最大位元組數。\n此處設定較大值可能會在選取範圍很大時導致效能問題。";
"General: Maximum number of characters before and after the click location to search when applying word selection regex patterns." = "一般： 套用單字選取正規表示式模式時，在點擊位置前後搜尋的最大字元數。";
"General: Maximum number of lines before and after the click location to include in smart selection." = "一般： 智慧選取中包含點擊位置前後的最大行數。";
"General: Maximum number of trigger-launched commands that can run at once.\nIf too many “Run Command…” triggers fire their commands will be queued. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "一般： 可同時執行的最大觸發器啟動指令數。\n如果過多的「執行指令…」觸發器觸發，其指令將排隊。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Maximum pixel height for a single screenshot file.\nScreenshots taller than this will be split into multiple files. Also affects the maximum total pixels (this value squared / 5)." = "一般： 單個截圖檔案的最大像素高度。\n高於此高度的截圖將被拆分為多個檔案。也影響最大總像素數（此值的平方 / 5）。";
"General: Number of autocomplete options to present.\nA value less than 100 is recommended." = "一般： 要呈現的自動補全選項數量。\n建議使用小於 100 的值。";
"General: Omit session identifier from notifications.\nWhen enabled, notifications will only show the message without the session name and tab number prefix." = "一般： 從通知中省略工作階段識別碼。\n啟用後，通知將僅顯示訊息而不顯示工作階段名稱和分頁編號前綴。";
"General: Open a new window when you click the dock icon and no windows are already open, and also on app launch when no other windows are open?" = "一般： 當沒有視窗已開啟時點擊 Dock 圖示是否開啟新視窗，以及在應用啟動時沒有其他視窗開啟時是否也開啟？";
"General: Open a window at startup?\nThis is useful if you wish to use the system window restoration settings but not create a new window if none would be restored." = "一般： 啟動時開啟視窗？\n如果您希望使用系統視窗恢復設定但在不會恢復任何視窗時不建立新視窗，此設定很有用。";
"General: Path to folder with dynamic profiles.\nWhen empty, ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles will be used. You must restart iTerm2 after modifying this setting." = "一般： 動態設定檔檔案夾的路徑。\n為空時，將使用 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2/DynamicProfiles。修改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2。";
"General: Path to ftp for opening ftp: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/ftp to use the Homebrew install." = "一般： 用於開啟 ftp： URL 的 ftp 路徑。\n您可能需要將其設為 /usr/local/bin/ftp 以使用 Homebrew 安裝版本。";
"General: Path to telnet for opening telnet: URLs.\nYou may want to set this to /usr/local/bin/telnet to use the Homebrew install." = "一般： 用於開啟 telnet： URL 的 telnet 路徑。\n您可能需要將其設為 /usr/local/bin/telnet 以使用 Homebrew 安裝版本。";
"General: Perform dictionary lookups on force press.\nIf this is NO, force press will still preview the Semantic History action; only dictionary lookups can be disabled." = "一般： 在重按時執行詞典查找。\n如果為「否」，重按仍會預覽語意歷史操作；只有詞典查找可被停用。";
"General: Perform restorable state integrity checks?" = "一般： 執行可恢復狀態完整性檢查？";
"General: Pin Edit Session window to the session it originally edited.\nIf not set, it will affect the most recently active session." = "一般： 將「編輯工作階段」視窗固定到最初編輯的工作階段。\n如果未設定，它將影響最近活動的工作階段。";
"General: Rate limit for Alert triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "一般： 警告觸發器的速率限制。\n如果同一觸發器觸發的時間間隔（秒）小於此值，則會被抑制。";
"General: Rate limit for Notification triggers.\nIf the same trigger fires with less than this time interval (in seconds) between firings, it will be suppressed." = "一般： 通知觸發器的速率限制。\n如果同一觸發器觸發的時間間隔（秒）小於此值，則會被抑制。";
"General: Redraw the screen after the Clear Buffer menu item is selected.\nWhen enabled, the TTY size is briefly changed after clearing the buffer to cause the shell or current app to redraw." = "一般： 選擇「清除緩衝區」選單項目後重繪螢幕。\n啟用後，清除緩衝區後會短暫更改 TTY 大小以使 shell 或當前應用重繪。";
"General: Relay origin for companion iOS device pairing.\nMust be a bare https origin (scheme and host, no path), such as https://companion-relay.iterm2.com. The relay is the only transport, so this must be set for pairing to work; forks can point it at their own Worker. Leave empty to disable the relay entirely. The user defaults key is `CompanionRelayOrigin`." = "一般： iOS 伴侶裝置配對的中繼來源。\n必須是純 https 來源（協定和主機，無路徑），如 https：//companion-relay.iterm2.com。中繼是唯一的傳輸方式，因此必須設定此項配對才能運作；分支版本可指向自己的 Worker。留空則完全停用中繼。使用者預設鍵為 `CompanionRelayOrigin`。";
"General: Reveal file created by “Export All Settings and Data” in finder upon completion" = "一般： 完成後在 Finder 中顯示由「匯出所有設定和資料」建立的檔案。";
"General: Save scroll buffer when clearing screen.\nWhen enabled, saves the current screen into scroll back buffer instead of clearing it." = "一般： 清除螢幕時儲存捲動緩衝區。\n啟用後，將當前螢幕儲存到回捲緩衝區而非清除它。";
"General: Save the screen to scrollback when an app moves the cursor above the prompt.\nSome full-screen programs that don’t use the alternate screen buffer repaint by moving the cursor to the top of the screen and overwriting whatever was already there, destroying content you can still see. When enabled, iTerm2 first scrolls the visible screen into history so that content isn’t lost. Requires shell integration." = "一般： 當應用將游標移到提示符上方時將螢幕儲存到回捲。\n某些不使用備用螢幕緩衝區的全螢幕程式透過將游標移到螢幕頂部並覆蓋已有內容來重繪，從而破壞您仍可見的內容。啟用後，iTerm2 會先將可見螢幕捲動到歷史記錄中以避免內容遺失。需要 shell 整合。";
"General: Shard-map URL for companion iOS device pairing.\nAn https URL pointing directly at the static shard-map JSON, used to find the relay shard that serves the phone-to-mac connection. It is fetched verbatim (nothing is appended). Leave empty to use direct connections (such as if you run your own relay)." = "一般： iOS 伴侶裝置配對的分片映射 URL。\n指向靜態分片映射 JSON 的 https URL，用於查找服務於手機到 Mac 連線的中繼分片。原樣取得（不附加任何內容）。留空則使用直接連線（例如你執行自己的中繼）。";
"General: Should opening a script with iTerm2 disable the default profile's “Send Text at Start” setting?\nIf you use “open iTerm2 file.command” or drag a script onto iTerm2's icon and this setting is enabled then the script will be executed in lieu of the profile's “Send Text at Start” setting. If this setting is off then both will be executed." = "一般： 使用 iTerm2 開啟指令稿時是否停用預設設定檔的「啟動時傳送文字」設定？\n如果您使用「open iTerm2 file.command」或將指令稿拖到 iTerm2 圖示上且此設定已啟用，則將執行指令稿而非設定檔的「啟動時傳送文字」設定。如果此設定關閉，則兩者都會執行。";
"General: Should split pane navigation by direction wrap around?" = "一般： 按方向導覽分割窗格是否循環？";
"General: Show buttons at the top of a selected command?\nWhen you select a command by single clicking the command line or its output, buttons are shown on the top right with options like Copy and Share. Note that this setting only applies when marks are not “line style” such as when using Auto Composer." = "一般： 在選中指令的頂部顯示按鈕？\n當您透過單擊指令行或其輸出來選擇指令時，右上角會顯示帶有「複製」和「分享」等選項的按鈕。請注意，此設定僅在標記非「線條樣式」時適用，例如使用 Auto Composer 時。";
"General: Show hints in split pane menu items to indicate horizontal vs vertical semantics.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "一般： 在分割窗格選單項目中顯示提示以指示水平與垂直語意。\n更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"General: Suppress confirmation of terminal-initiated downloads?" = "一般： 抑制終端發起下載的確認？";
"General: Swap Find Next and Find Previous.\nIf enabled, Find Next will search up and Find Previous will search down (iTerm2's traditional behavior, which is a departure from macOS's standard). When disabled, search behaves like a normal macOS app." = "一般： 交換「尋找下一個」和「尋找上一個」。\n啟用後，「尋找下一個」將向上搜尋，「尋找上一個」將向下搜尋（iTerm2 的傳統行為，偏離 macOS 標準）。停用後，搜尋行為與普通 macOS 應用相同。";
"General: Synchronize search queries across windows and applications.\nNormally, when you enter a search query in a Find field all find fields in all applications get updated to hold the same value. This is utter nonsense, and can be disabled by setting this preference to No." = "一般： 跨視窗和應用同步搜尋查詢。\n通常，當您在尋找欄位中輸入搜尋查詢時，所有應用中的所有尋找欄位都會更新為相同值。這完全沒有意義，可透過將此偏好設為「否」來停用。";
"General: System notifications should be silent." = "一般： 系統通知應為靜默。";
"General: Template for URL of search engine.\niTerm2 replaces the string “%@” with the text to search for. Query parameter percent escaping is used." = "一般： 搜尋引擎 URL 的範本。\niTerm2 會將字串「%@」替換為要搜尋的文字。使用查詢參數百分號轉義。";
"General: Template of URL for typeahead search suggestions.\niTerm replaces the string “%@” with the text to search for. Query parameter percent escaping is used." = "一般： 預輸入搜尋建議 URL 的範本。\niTerm 會將字串「%@」替換為要搜尋的文字。使用查詢參數百分號轉義。";
"General: Time in seconds before a session is considered idle.\nUsed for updating icons and activity indicator in tabs." = "一般： 工作階段被視為閒置前的時間（秒）。\n用於更新分頁中的圖示和活動指示器。";
"General: Time to wait before performing Find action on 1- or 2- character queries." = "一般： 對 1 或 2 個字元的查詢執行尋找操作前等待的時間。";
"General: Time to wait before showing tips in the main menu.\nSet this to a big number if you don’t like the tips." = "一般： 在主選單中顯示提示前等待的時間。\n如果您不喜歡提示，請將此值設為一個較大的數字。";
"General: Timeout (seconds) for evaluating RPCs.\nThis applies to invoking functions registered by scripts when using the Swift syntax for inline expressions." = "一般： 評估 RPC 的逾時時間（秒）。\n這適用於在使用內嵌表達式的 Swift 語法時呼叫指令稿註冊的函式。";
"General: Timeout for downloading settings" = "一般： 下載設定的逾時時間。";
"General: Timeout in seconds when running git for the status bar component." = "一般： 狀態列元件執行 git 時的逾時時間（秒）。";
"General: Treat the top row of keys like number keys on an English keyboard for the purposes of switching panes, tabs, and windows with modifier+number.\nFor example, AZERTY requires you to hold down Shift to enter a number. To switch tabs with ⌘+Number on an AZERTY keyboard, you must enable this setting. Then, for example, ⌘-& switches to tab 1. When this setting is enabled, some user-defined shortcuts may become unavailable because the tab/window/pane switching behavior takes precedence." = "一般： 為了使用修飾鍵+數字切換分割窗格、分頁和視窗，將頂行按鍵視為英文鍵盤上的數字鍵。\n例如，AZERTY 鍵盤需要按住 Shift 才能輸入數字。要在 AZERTY 鍵盤上使用 ⌘+數字切換分頁，必須啟用此設定。這樣，例如 ⌘-& 可切換到分頁 1。啟用此設定後，某些使用者自訂快捷鍵可能不可用，因為分頁/視窗/分割窗格切換行為優先。";
"General: URL to check for updates to the AI model catalog.\nThe catalog defines the built-in AI models (context window, capabilities, and the recommended model per vendor). iTerm2 periodically downloads a signed newer copy so new models become available without an app update. This happens only when AI features are enabled and you have granted permission; a non-empty URL by itself does not enable checking. Clearing this URL disables checking entirely." = "一般： 用於檢查 AI 模型目錄更新的 URL。\n該目錄定義了內建 AI 模型（上下文視窗、功能以及每個供應商的推薦模型）。iTerm2 會定期下載簽名的較新副本，使新模型無需應用程式更新即可使用。這僅在啟用 AI 功能且你已授權時才會發生；僅 URL 非空不會啟用檢查。清除此 URL 將完全停用檢查。";
"General: Use Open Directory to determine the user shell" = "一般： 使用 Open Directory 確定使用者 shell。";
"General: Use old-style find and paste progress indicator views.\nThis change will only affect new windows." = "一般： 使用舊式尋找和貼上進度指示器視圖。\n此更改僅影響新視窗。";
"General: User agent for web views. Leave empty to use system default." = "一般： Web 檢視的使用者代理。留空以使用系統預設值。";
"General: Value to set LC_CTYPE to if the machine‘s combination of country and language are not supported.\nIf unset, the encoding (e.g., UTF-8) will be used." = "一般： 當機器的國家和語言組合不受支援時要將 LC_CTYPE 設定為的值。\n如果未設定，將使用編碼（例如 UTF-8）。";
"General: When sorting command history for auto command completion: how much should number of uses of a command contribute to its score? A higher score moves the command closer to the top of the list.\nUse 0 to ignore number of uses." = "一般： 對命令歷史進行排序以用於自動命令補全時：指令使用次數對其得分的貢獻程度？得分越高指令越靠近列表頂部。\n設為 0 可忽略使用次數。";
"General: When sorting command history for auto command completion: how much should the time-since-last-use of a command contribute to its score? A higher score moves the command closer to the top of the list.\nUse 0 to ignore time since last use." = "一般： 對命令歷史進行排序以用於自動命令補全時：指令距上次使用的時間對其得分的貢獻程度？得分越高指令越靠近列表頂部。\n設為 0 可忽略距上次使用的時間。";
"Global key bindings" = "全域按鍵映射";
"Google Gemini" = "Google Gemini";
"HTTP request failed: %@" = "HTTP 請求失敗：%@";
"Height of progress bars in points" = "進度列的高度（以點為單位）";
"Hex codes:" = "十六進位碼：";
"Hide content regex visualization" = "隱藏內容正規表示式視覺化";
"Hide visualization" = "隱藏視覺化";
"Highlight color for search matches" = "搜尋符合高亮顏色";
"Highlight color for search matches in dark mode" = "搜尋符合高亮顏色（深色模式）";
"Highlight color for search matches in light mode" = "搜尋符合高亮顏色（明亮模式）";
"Horizontal spacing multiplier between characters" = "字元之間的水平間距倍數";
"Hosted code interpreter" = "託管程式碼解譯器";
"Hosted file search" = "託管檔案搜尋";
"Hosted web search" = "託管網路搜尋";
"Hotkey Window" = "熱鍵視窗";
"Hotkey Window Successfully Configured" = "熱鍵視窗設定成功";
"Hotkey: Duration in seconds of the Open Quickly window height animation.\nSet to 0 to disable the animation." = "熱鍵： 「快速開啟」視窗高度動畫的時長（秒）。\n設為 0 可停用動畫。";
"Hotkey: Duration in seconds of the hotkey window animation.\nWarning: reducing this value may cause problems if you have multiple displays." = "熱鍵： 熱鍵視窗動畫的時長（秒）。\n警告：如果您有多個顯示器，減小此值可能會導致問題。";
"Hotkey: If the only window is a hotkey window, then clicking the dock icon shows or hides it." = "熱鍵： 如果唯一的視窗是熱鍵視窗，則點擊 Dock 圖示會顯示或隱藏它。";
"Hotkey: Show indicator for pinned hotkey windows." = "熱鍵： 為固定的熱鍵視窗顯示指示器。";
