"Send Text without Broadcasting" = "傳送文字（不廣播）";
"Send tmux Command" = "傳送 tmux 命令";
"Sequence…" = "序列…";
"Split" = "分割";
"Split Horizontally with Profile" = "使用設定檔水平分割";
"Split Panes" = "分割窗格";
"Split Vertically with Profile" = "使用設定檔垂直分割";
"SSH Integration: Command used to set the `uname` variable.\nThe main use of this is to use in the AI prompt so the language model knows the operating system." = "SSH 整合： 用於設定 `uname` 變數的命令。\n主要用途是在 AI 提示詞中使用，讓語言模型了解作業系統。";
"SSH Integration: Valid characters in SSH user names\nAlphanumerics are always valid. This specifies other valid characters." = "SSH 整合： SSH 使用者名稱中的有效字元\n字母數字始終有效。此項指定其他有效字元。";
"SSH connection configuration dictionary" = "SSH 連線設定字典";
"Save" = "儲存";
"Scripting: Set IT2_APP_PATH environment variable on new sessions, pointing at this iTerm2 build’s app bundle?\nThis disambiguates the AppleScript target when multiple iTerm2 builds with the same bundle identifier are running, so that the “it2” CLI requests its cookie from this iTerm2 instance. Intended for iTerm2 developers. Only affects sessions created after changing this setting." = "腳本： 在新工作階段上設定 IT2_APP_PATH 環境變數，指向此 iTerm2 建置版本的 app bundle？\n當具有相同 bundle identifier 的多個 iTerm2 建置版本同時執行時，這可消除 AppleScript 目標的歧義，使「it2」CLI 向此 iTerm2 實例請求其 cookie。面向 iTerm2 開發者。僅影響更改此設定後建立的工作階段。";
"Scripting: Set ITERM2_COOKIE environment variable, allowing Python scripts to be launched without confirmation?\nThis will only affect sessions created after changing this setting." = "腳本： 設定 ITERM2_COOKIE 環境變數，允許無需確認即啟動 Python 腳本？\n這僅影響更改此設定後建立的工作階段。";
"Scripting: Should references to undefined variables in interpolated strings be converted to empty string?\nWhen enabled, an expression in an interpolated string that references an undefined variable will be treated as an empty string. For example, “\\(bogus)”. References to undefined variables as arguments to function calls, such as “\\(f(bogus))”, are still errors." = "腳本： 插值字串中對未定義變數的參照是否應轉換為空字串？\n啟用時，插值字串中參照未定義變數的運算式將被視為空字串。例如「\\(bogus)」。作為函式呼叫引數的未定義變數參照（如「\\(f(bogus))」）仍為錯誤。";
"Scripting: URL of the uv download manifest (used when the Python runtime is provisioned with uv)." = "腳本： uv 下載清單的 URL（在使用 uv 配備 Python 執行時期時使用）。";
"Scripting: URL to check for new Beta versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "腳本： 用於檢查 Python 腳本執行時期新 Beta 版本的 URL。";
"Scripting: URL to check for new versions of the Python scripting runtime." = "腳本： 用於檢查 Python 腳本執行時期新版本的 URL。";
"Scripting: Use uv to provision the Python runtime for API scripts?\nWhen enabled, iTerm2 uses uv to download Python and build per-script environments instead of the bundled Python runtime. Scripts already provisioned continue to run regardless of this setting; it only affects creating, importing, and migrating scripts." = "腳本： 使用 uv 為 API 腳本配備 Python 執行時期？\n啟用時，iTerm2 使用 uv 下載 Python 並為每個腳本建置環境，而非使用內建的 Python 執行時期。已配備的腳本無論此設定如何都繼續執行；它僅影響腳本的建立、匯入和遷移。";
"Search Options" = "搜尋選項";
"Seconds between anti-idle codes" = "兩次防閒置代碼之間的間隔秒數";
"Seconds between folder background image changes" = "資料夾背景影像更換之間的間隔秒數";
"Seconds to allow undoing session close" = "允許復原關閉工作階段的秒數";
"Seconds to hold the cursor fully hidden between fades when smooth blink is enabled" = "啟用平滑閃爍時兩次淡入淡出之間游標完全隱藏的持續時間（秒）";
"Seconds to hold the cursor fully visible between fades when smooth blink is enabled" = "啟用平滑閃爍時兩次淡入淡出之間游標完全可見的持續時間（秒）";
"Select Action…" = "選擇動作…";
"Select Menu Item" = "選擇選單項目";
"Select Menu Item “%@”" = "選擇選單項目「%@」";
"Select Next Pane" = "選擇下一個分割窗格";
"Select Pane Above" = "選擇上方分割窗格";
"Select Pane Below" = "選擇下方分割窗格";
"Select Pane Left" = "選擇左側分割窗格";
"Select Pane Right" = "選擇右側分割窗格";
"Select Previous Pane" = "選擇上一個分割窗格";
"Select View > Customize Touch Bar to enable your new touch bar item." = "選擇「顯示 > 自訂觸控列」以啟用您的新觸控列項目。";
"Select the profiles into which these triggers should be imported:\n\n%@" = "選擇要將這些觸發器匯入到哪些設定檔：\n\n%@";
"Semantic History: Characters never considered part of a URL.\nThe characters in this string may never occur in a URL; when one is seen that delineates the beginning or end of a URL." = "語意歷史： 絕不視為 URL 一部分的字元。\n此字串中的字元不得出現在 URL 中；當遇到其中一個時，即界定 URL 的起始或結束。";
"Semantic History: Characters to ignore at the end of a URL" = "語意歷史： URL 結尾要忽略的字元。";
"Semantic History: Check smart selection actions before existing files on cmd-click?" = "語意歷史： 在 cmd-點擊時，先檢查智慧選取操作再檢查現有檔案？";
"Semantic History: Command to run when opening a clicked URL, instead of asking the OS to open it.\nWhen non-empty, this command runs as a silent background task via /bin/sh -c whenever you click a URL (including OSC 8 hyperlinks and auto-detected URLs) that iTerm2 would otherwise hand to the system. This is an interpolated string; use \\(url) for the URL and \\(background) for whether a background open was requested (1 if you held option while clicking, otherwise 0). The command is responsible for opening the URL however it likes (e.g., “open -g \\(url)” to open in the background). When empty, URLs open normally. iTerm2-internal schemes (iterm2:), URL schemes bound to a profile, and Semantic History file links are not affected." = "語意歷史： 點擊 URL 時執行的命令，而不是請求系統開啟它。\n非空時，每當點擊 iTerm2 原本應交給系統處理的 URL（包括 OSC 8 超連結和自動偵測到的 URL），該命令會透過 /bin/sh -c 作為靜默背景工作執行。這是一個插值字串；用 \\(url) 表示 URL，用 \\(background) 表示是否請求了背景開啟（按住 option 點擊時為 1，否則為 0）。命令自行負責以任何方式開啟 URL（例如「open -g \\(url)」可在背景開啟）。為空時，URL 正常開啟。iTerm2 內部方案（iterm2：）、綁定到設定檔的 URL 方案以及語意歷史檔案連結不受影響。";
"Semantic History: Default URL scheme.\nThis is applied to hostnames that are not a single word." = "語意歷史： 預設 URL 方案。\n套用於非單個單字的主機名稱。";
"Semantic History: Disable performing the first matching Smart Selection’s Action on cmd-click?" = "語意歷史： 在 cmd-點擊時停用執行第一個符合的智慧選取操作？";
"Semantic History: Enable semantic history for network-mounted filesystems?\nOnly enable this if you know your network-mounted filesystems are really fast and reliable. A slow filesystem may cause the entire iTerm2 app to hang." = "語意歷史： 為網路掛載的檔案系統啟用語意歷史？\n只有在你的網路掛載檔案系統確實快速且可靠時才啟用。緩慢的檔案系統可能導致整個 iTerm2 應用程式卡死。";
"Semantic History: Ignore hard newlines for the purposes of locating URLs and file names for Semantic History.\nIf a hard newline occurs at the end of a line then ⌘-click will not see it all unless this setting is turned on. This is useful for some interactive applications. Turning this on will remove newlines from the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "語義歷史： 為語意歷史定位 URL 和檔案名稱時忽略硬換行。\n如果硬換行出現在行尾，除非啟用此設定，否則按 ⌘ 點擊將無法看到全部內容。這對某些互動式應用很有用。啟用後會從 \\3 和 \\4 替換中移除換行符。";
"Semantic History: Maximum number of bytes of text before and after click location to take into account.\nThis also limits the size of the \\3 and \\4 substitutions." = "語義歷史： 點擊位置前後納入考量的文字最大位元組數。\n這也限制 \\3 和 \\4 替換的大小。";
"Semantic History: Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a URL or file name for Semantic History.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a URL begins and ends. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "語意歷史： 被視為語意歷史 URL 或檔案名稱一部分的非字母數字字元。\n字母和數字始終被視為 URL 的一部分。這些非字母數字字元額外用於確定 URL 的起始和結束位置。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Semantic History: Non-alphanumeric characters considered part of a filename. Note that URL characters (a separate advanced setting) are also allowed.\nLetters and numbers are always considered part of the URL. These non-alphanumeric characters are used in addition for the purposes of figuring out where a file begins and ends. You must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "語意歷史： 被視為檔案名稱一部分的非字母數字字元。請注意，URL 字元（單獨的進階設定）也被允許。\n字母和數字始終被視為 URL 的一部分。這些非字母數字字元額外用於確定檔案的起始和結束位置。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Semantic History: Only consider a two+ part domain-name to be a URL if it also contains a slash.\nThis setting is used when guessing if a string is a URL for semantic history. When enabled, `example.com` would not be considered a URL but `example.com/` would be." = "語義歷史： 僅當兩部分及以上網域名稱還包含斜線時才將其視為 URL。\n此設定用於猜測字串是否為語意歷史 URL。啟用後，`example.com` 不會被當作 URL，但 `example.com/` 會被當作 URL。";
"Semantic History: Paths to ignore for Semantic History.\nSeparate paths with a comma. Any file under one of these paths will not be openable with Semantic History. It is wise to add network file systems to this list, since they can be very slow." = "語義歷史： 語意歷史要忽略的路徑。\n以逗號分隔路徑。這些路徑下的任何檔案都無法用語意歷史開啟。建議將網路檔案系統新增到此列表，因為它們可能非常慢。";
"Semantic History: Respect soft boundaries for computing the prefix and suffix text passed to semantic history commands?\nDue to a long-standing bug this did not used to be respected. Soft boundaries were always respected for deciding what text was clicked on, but the prefix and suffix did not. If you have a semantic history command that depends on the bug, you can switch this off to get the pre-3.1.2 behavior." = "語意歷史： 在計算傳遞給語意歷史命令的前綴和後綴文字時，是否遵循軟邊界？\n由於一個長期存在的 bug，過去並未遵循此設定。在判斷點擊了哪個文字時始終會遵循軟邊界，但前綴和後綴不會。如果你的語意歷史命令依賴於該 bug，可以關閉此項以獲得 3.1.2 之前的行為。";
"Semantic History: URLs must contain a scheme?\nEnable this to reduce the number of false positives that semantic history thinks are a URL" = "語義歷史： URL 必須包含方案？\n啟用此項可減少語意歷史誤判為 URL 的假陽性數量。";
"Semantic History: Use a yellow for a Shell Integration prompt mark when the job is stopped by a signal." = "語義歷史： 當作業被信號停止時，Shell 整合提示標記使用黃色。";
"Send Escape Sequence…" = "傳送逸出序列…";
"Send Hex Code…" = "傳送十六進位碼…";
"Send Text…" = "傳送文字…";
"Send text…" = "傳送文字…";
"Session: Allow sessions to survive logging out and back in.\nThis breaks the “auth sufficient pam_tid.so” hack some people use to allow sudo to authenticate with Touch ID." = "工作階段： 允許工作階段在登出並重新登入後繼續存活。\n這會破壞一些人用來讓 sudo 透過 Touch ID 認證的「auth sufficient pam_tid.so」 hack。";
"Session: Auto-lock session name after editing it." = "工作階段： 編輯工作階段名稱後自動鎖定。";
"Session: Automatic session logging appends to existing files.\nWhen set to No, the file will be overwritten instead." = "工作階段： 自動工作階段日誌附加到現有檔案。\n設為「否」時，將改為覆寫檔案。";
"Session: Character to use for divider lines in session end messages. Leave empty to use secure default (BrokenPipeDivider image). Examples: ━ ─ ═ ╌ ┄" = "工作階段： 工作階段結束訊息中分隔線使用的字元。留空則使用安全預設值（BrokenPipeDivider 影像）。範例：━ ─ ═ ╌ ┄";
"Session: Enable session restoration.\nSession restoration runs jobs in separate processes. They will survive crashes, force quits, and upgrades.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for this change to take effect." = "工作階段： 啟用工作階段復原。\n工作階段復原在獨立行程中執行作業。它們將在崩潰、強制退出和升級後繼續存活。\n你必須重啟 iTerm2 此更改才會生效。";
"Session: Format for automatic session log filenames.\nSee the Badges documentation for supported substitutions." = "工作階段： 自動工作階段日誌檔名的格式。\n有關支援的替換變數，請參閱徽章文件。";
"Session: Format for log timestamps. See Unicode TR 35-31 for syntax.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for changes to this setting to take effect." = "工作階段： 日誌時間戳的格式。語法請參見 Unicode TR 35-31。\n你必須重啟 iTerm2 此設定的更改才會生效。";
"Session: Hex codes to send to clear the command line when entering the composer.\n0x15 is ^U, 0x0b is ^K." = "工作階段： 進入編輯器時傳送以清空命令列的十六進位代碼。\n0x15 為 ^U，0x0b 為 ^K。";
"Session: How long to wait when trying to attach to an iTerm daemon at startup when restoring windows (in seconds)?" = "工作階段： 啟動時復原視窗並嘗試連接 iTerm 常駐程式時等待多久（以秒為單位）？";
"Session: Preserve font zoom level when Automatic Profile Switching changes profiles." = "工作階段： 自動設定檔切換更改設定檔時保留字型縮放級別。";
"Session: Show a “Switched to profile” message when Automatic Profile Switching activates." = "工作階段： 自動設定檔切換啟用時顯示「已切換到設定檔」訊息。";
"Session: Suppress restart session confirmation alert.\nDon't ask for a confirmation when manually restarting a session." = "工作階段： 隱藏重啟工作階段確認警告。\n手動重啟工作階段時不詢問確認。";
"Session: Suppress the Restart Session offer.\nWhen a session terminates, it will offer to restart itself. Turn this on to suppress the offer permanently." = "工作階段： 隱藏「重啟工作階段」的提議。\n當工作階段終止時，它會提議重啟自身。開啟此項可永久隱藏該提議。";
"Session: Temporarily add a composer to the status bar instead of opening the large composer view when a status bar is present." = "工作階段： 當狀態列存在時，臨時將編輯器新增到狀態列，而不是開啟大型編輯器檢視。";
"Session: Text displayed when a session ends. Leave empty to use default." = "工作階段： 工作階段結束時顯示的文字。留空則使用預設值。";
"Session: Text displayed when a session is restarted." = "工作階段： 工作階段重啟時顯示的文字。";
"Session: Text displayed when a short-lived session finishes." = "工作階段： 短暫工作階段結束時顯示的文字。";
"Session: User-initiated Quit (⌘Q) of iTerm2 will kill all running jobs.\nApplies only when session restoration is on." = "工作階段： 使用者發起的 iTerm2 退出（⌘Q）會終止所有正在執行的作業。\n僅在啟用工作階段復原時生效。";
"Session: When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for erroneous completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "工作階段： 當「下次標記時提醒」設定為播放聲音時，上一個命令錯誤完成時使用此名稱的檔案。\n你可以指定系統聲音或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的檔案。";
"Session: When Alert on Next Mark is configured to play a sound, use a file with this name for successful completion of the previous command.\nYou can name a system sound or a file in ~/Library/Sounds." = "工作階段： 當「下次標記時提醒」設定為播放聲音時，上一個命令成功完成時使用此名稱的檔案。\n你可以指定系統聲音或 ~/Library/Sounds 中的檔案。";
"Session: When focus follows mouse is enabled, should new split panes automatically be focused?" = "工作階段： 啟用焦點跟隨滑鼠時，新分割的分割窗格是否應自動獲得焦點？";
"Session: When logging plain text, include timestamps for each line?" = "工作階段： 記錄純文字時，是否為每行包含時間戳？";
"Session: When restoring a session without restoring a running job, draw a banner saying “Session Contents Restored” below the restored contents." = "工作階段： 在不復原執行中的作業而復原工作階段時，在復原的內容下方繪製一條橫幅，顯示「工作階段內容已復原」。";
"Set job above" = "設定上方的任務";
"Settings" = "設定";
"Settings and your snippets, notes, or icon customizations have changed. Copy them to %@?" = "設定以及您的程式碼片段、備忘錄或圖示自訂已變更。要將它們複製到 %@ 嗎？";
"Settings cannot be copied to a URL." = "設定無法複製到 URL。";
"Settings have changed. Copy them to %@?" = "設定已變更。要將它們複製到 %@ 嗎？";
"Settings: %@" = "設定：%@";
"Shortcuts" = "快捷鍵";
"Show content regex visualization" = "顯示內容正規表示式視覺化";
"Show indicators for non-default values" = "顯示非預設值的指示標記";
"Show visualization" = "顯示視覺化";
"Smart Selection" = "智慧選取";
"Smart Selection Ignoring Newlines" = "智慧選取（忽略換行符）";
"Smart Selection Playground\nEnter text here, then click to see which rule matches at that location." = "智慧選取試驗場\n在此輸入文字，然後點擊查看該位置匹配哪條規則。";
"Snippets" = "程式碼片段";
"Start Instant Replay" = "開始即時重播";
"Streaming responses" = "串流回應";
"String sent in response to ENQ character" = "回應 ENQ 字元時傳送的字串";
"Style of timestamp display" = "時間戳記顯示樣式";
"Subtitle shown below profile name in Open Quickly" = "在「快速開啟」中顯示在設定檔名稱下方的副標題";
"Supports temperature" = "支援溫度";
"Swap With Next Pane" = "與下一個分割窗格交換";
"Swap With Previous Pane" = "與上一個分割窗格交換";
"Swap With Split Pane Above" = "與上方分割窗格交換";
"Swap With Split Pane Below" = "與下方分割窗格交換";
"Swap With Split Pane on Left" = "與左側分割窗格交換";
"Swap With Split Pane on Right" = "與右側分割窗格交換";
"Sync These Too" = "同時同步這些";
"System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable System Settings > General > Close windows when quitting an app to enable window restoration." = "系統視窗回復已停用，這使 iTerm2 無法遵循此設定。停用系統設定 > 一般 > 結束 App 時關閉視窗以啟用視窗回復。";
"System window restoration has been disabled, which prevents iTerm2 from respecting this setting. Disable ”System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an application“ to enable window restoration." = "系統視窗回復已停用，這使 iTerm2 無法遵循此設定。停用”系統設定 > 桌面與釘選 > 結束 App 時關閉視窗“以啟用視窗回復。";
"Tab Color" = "分頁顏色";
"Tab Color in dark mode" = "分頁顏色（深色模式）";
"Tab Color in light mode" = "分頁顏色（明亮模式）";
"Tabs: Add items to Recents (in the dock icon's menu) to reopen recently used profiles as tabs?" = "分頁： 將項目新增到「最近使用」（Dock 圖示選單中），以分頁形式重新開啟最近使用的設定檔？";
"Tabs: Allow a tab to be dragged and dropped outside any existing tab bar to create a new window." = "分頁： 允許將分頁拖放到任何現有分頁列之外以建立新視窗。";
"Tabs: Allow dragging window by the Add Tab button in the tab bar?" = "分頁： 允許透過分頁列中的「新增分頁」按鈕拖動視窗？";
"Tabs: Allow two-finger interactive swipe between tabs?\nThe system preference Trackpad > More Gestures > Swipe between pages controls this globally. When “swipe with two fingers” is enabled, you can change this setting to “No” to prevent swiping between tabs in iTerm2." = "分頁： 允許雙指在分頁之間互動滑動？\n系統偏好設定「觸控板 > 更多手勢 > 在頁面之間滑動」全域控制此功能。當「用雙指滑動」啟用時，可將此設定改為「否」以阻止在 iTerm2 中在分頁之間滑動。";
"Tabs: Alpha value for tab color for non-selected colored tabs in the Minimal theme.\nMust be between 0 and 1." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，非選中彩色分頁的分頁顏色 alpha 值。\n必須在 0 到 1 之間。";
"Tabs: Animation duration for fade in/out animation of tabs in full screen, in seconds." = "分頁： 全螢幕下分頁淡入淡出動畫的時長（秒）。";
"Tabs: Choosing a profile from the “Profiles” menu opens a new window.\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "分頁： 從「設定檔」選單選擇設定檔時會開啟新視窗。\n更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target fill when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 拖動分割窗格時放置目標填充的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target inner border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 拖動分割窗格時放置目標內邊框的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Color of drop target outer border when dragging a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 拖動分割窗格時放置目標外邊框的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane fill when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 移動/交換分割窗格時來源窗格填充的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane inner border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 移動/交換分割窗格時來源窗格內邊框的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Color of source pane outer border when moving/swapping a split pane.\nShould be a web-style color, #rrggbb. You can also use p3#rrggbb for p3 color space." = "分頁： 移動/交換分割窗格時來源窗格外邊框的顏色。\n應為 web 風格顏色 #rrggbb。也可使用 p3#rrggbb 表示 p3 顏色空間。";
"Tabs: Colors for tab color menu item.\nSpace delimited strings like #rrggbb or #rgb in sRGB color space. If the P3 color space is available, you can use strings like: color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)" = "分頁： 分頁顏色選單項目的顏色。\n以空格分隔的字串，如 sRGB 顏色空間中的 #rrggbb 或 #rgb。如果 P3 顏色空間可用，可使用如下字串：color(p3 1 0.5 0.25)。";
"Tabs: Custom tab label font size\nFor this to take effect, turn on “Use custom font size for tab labels?”." = "分頁： 自訂分頁標籤字型大小\n要使此設定生效，請開啟「為分頁標籤使用自訂字型大小？」。";
"Tabs: Default tab bar height\nThis does not affect the minimal or compact themes. On macOS 26 Tahoe-style tabs, the top (horizontal) tab bar uses the system height and ignores this setting; left/right (vertical) tabs use max(26, this value) for each tab’s height." = "分頁： 預設分頁列高度\n此設定不影響 Minimal 或 Compact 主題。在 macOS 26 Tahoe 風格分頁上，頂部（水平）分頁列使用系統高度並忽略此設定；左/右（垂直）分頁使用 max(26， 此值) 作為每個分頁的高度。";
"Tabs: Disable tab bar tooltips?" = "分頁： 停用分頁列工具提示？";
"Tabs: Draw bottom line for horizontal tabbar in Regular, Dark and Light theme?" = "分頁： 在 Regular、Dark 和 Light 主題中為水平分頁列繪製底線？";
"Tabs: High Contrast modes maximize visibility.\nWhen enabled, the dark high-contrast theme emphasizes visibility over beauty." = "分頁： 高對比度模式可最大化可見性。\n啟用後，深色高對比主題將優先注重可見性而非美觀。";
"Tabs: How far must the mouse move before a tab drag is initiated?\nYou must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "分頁： 滑鼠移動多遠後才開始拖動分頁？\n更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Tabs: How long in seconds to show tabs in fullscreen.\nThe tab bar appears briefly in fullscreen when the number of tabs changes or you switch tabs. This setting gives the time in seconds for it to remain visible." = "分頁： 全螢幕時顯示分頁的時長（秒）。\n當分頁數量變化或切換分頁時，分頁列會在全螢幕下短暫出現。此設定指定其保持可見的時間（秒）。";
"Tabs: How much should contrast be increased for text in tabs in the Minimal theme?\nChoose a value larger than 1 to increase contrast. Values between 0 and 1 have less contrast than the default." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，分頁文字的對比度應增加多少？\n選擇大於 1 的值可增加對比度。0 到 1 之間的值對比度低於預設值。";
"Tabs: How prominent should the outline around the selected tab be drawn when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 3, where 0 means no outline and 3 means a very prominent outline." = "分頁： 當視窗中有彩色分頁時，選中分頁周圍輪廓的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 3，其中 0 表示無輪廓，3 表示非常突出的輪廓。";
"Tabs: How prominent should the text in a non-selected tab be when there are colored tabs in a window?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, the alpha value." = "分頁： 當視窗中有彩色分頁時，非選中分頁中文字的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，即 alpha 值。";
"Tabs: Ignore System Settings > Dock > Prefer tabs when opening documents?\nWhen set to No, asking to open a window will open a tab instead when system settings is configured to prefer tabs over windows. When set to Yes, asking to open a window may open a tab instead." = "分頁： 忽略「系統設定 > Dock > 打開文稿時偏好分頁」？\n設為「否」時，若系統設定配置為優先使用分頁而非視窗，則請求開啟視窗時會改為開啟分頁。設為「是」時，請求開啟視窗可能會改為開啟分頁。";
"Tabs: In the Compact theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "分頁： 在 Compact 主題中，可以從視窗邊緣附近的區域開始拖動來移動視窗。此設定指定該區域的大小。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal and Compact themes when there is a single tab and the tab bar is visible, should dragging the tab bar move the window?\nThis also affects windows without titlebars in any theme." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 和 Compact 主題中，當只有一個分頁且分頁列可見時，拖動分頁列是否移動視窗？\n此設定也適用於任何主題中無標題列的視窗。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how different should the background color of the selected tab be from the others?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is no difference and 1 very different." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，選中分頁的背景顏色與其他分頁的差異程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示無差異，1 表示差異很大。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how prominent should split pane dividers be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，分割窗格分隔線的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示不可見，1 表示非常突出。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, how prominent should the tab outline be?\nTakes a value in 0 to 1, where 0 is invisible and 1 is very prominent" = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，分頁輪廓的突出程度？\n取值 0 到 1，其中 0 表示不可見，1 表示非常突出。";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, should the area left of the tab bar be treated as part of the first tab?" = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，分頁列左側的區域是否應視為第一個分頁的一部分？";
"Tabs: In the Minimal theme, you can move the window by dragging starting in a region on the edge near the window border. This gives the size of that region." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，可以從視窗邊緣附近的區域開始拖動來移動視窗。此設定指定該區域的大小。";
"Tabs: Minimum tab width when using uneven tab widths for compact tabs." = "分頁： 緊湊分頁使用不均勻寬度時的最小分頁寬度。";
"Tabs: Minimum tab width when using uneven tab widths." = "分頁： 使用不均勻分頁寬度時的最小分頁寬度。";
"Tabs: Minimum width for tab labels.\nThe activity/bell icon will be hidden when the space for the label drops below this size (in points)" = "分頁： 分頁標籤的最小寬度。\n當標籤可用空間低於此尺寸（點）時，活動/響鈴圖示將被隱藏。";
"Tabs: Next Pane and Previous Pane commands use reading order, not the time of last use." = "分頁： 「下一分割窗格」和「上一分割窗格」指令使用閱讀順序，而非上次使用時間。";
"Tabs: Place the tabbar in the window's titlebar in full screen mode (macOS 13+ only)?\nThis can be disabled to work around a bug in macOS where tabs may not be visible in full screen." = "分頁： 在全螢幕模式下將分頁列放置在視窗標題列中（僅限 macOS 13+）？\n可停用此項以繞過 macOS 中全螢幕下分頁可能不可見的錯誤。";
"Tabs: Preferred tab width when tabs are equally sized." = "分頁： 分頁等寬時的首選分頁寬度。";
"Tabs: Prominence of selected tab underline indicator in the Minimal theme when there is at least one colored tab." = "分頁： 在 Minimal 主題中，當至少有一個彩色分頁時選中分頁底線指示器的突出程度。";
"Tabs: Remove the “new tab” button from horizontal tab bars?" = "分頁： 從水平分頁列中移除「新增分頁」按鈕？";
"Tabs: Select tabs on mouse-down?\nChanging this setting will not affect existing windows." = "分頁： 在滑鼠按下時選擇分頁？\n更改此設定不會影響現有視窗。";
"Tabs: Select the tab to the left when closing a tab?\nIf disabled, the tab to the right of the closing tab will be selected." = "分頁： 關閉分頁時選擇左側的分頁？\n如果停用，將選擇關閉分頁右側的分頁。";
"Tabs: Should double-clicking a tab open a window to edit its title?" = "分頁： 雙擊分頁是否開啟視窗編輯其標題？";
"Tabs: Should middle-click on a tab in the tab bar close the tab?" = "分頁： 在分頁列中中鍵點擊分頁是否關閉該分頁？";
"Tabs: Should tab close buttons always remain visible?" = "分頁： 分頁關閉按鈕是否始終保持可見？";
"Tabs: Should the “new tab” button in the tab bar use the current session’s profile?\nWhen enabled, clicking the “+” button opens a new tab with the current session’s profile instead of the default profile." = "分頁： 分頁列中的「新增分頁」按鈕是否使用當前工作階段的設定檔？\n啟用後，點擊「+」按鈕會使用當前工作階段的設定檔而非預設設定檔開啟新分頁。";
"Tabs: Tab bar height (points) for the Minimal theme.\nThe default is 38. Use 22 to match the compact theme's height." = "分頁： Minimal 主題的分頁列高度（點）。\n預設值為 38。使用 22 可與緊湊主題的高度一致。";
"Tabs: Tab width when the tab bar is scrollable.\nUsed as the fixed width when tabs are equally sized, and as the minimum width when uneven tab widths are allowed." = "分頁： 分頁列可捲動時的分頁寬度。\n在分頁等寬時用作固定寬度，在允許不均勻寬度時用作最小寬度。";
"Tabs: Uneven tab widths allowed." = "分頁： 允許分頁寬度不均勻。";
"Tabs: Use Sequoia-style tabs in Tahoe and later?" = "分頁： 在 Tahoe 及更高版本中使用 Sequoia 風格分頁？";
"Tabs: Use custom font size for tab labels?\nSee also advanced setting “Custom tab label font size”." = "分頁： 為分頁標籤使用自訂字型大小？\n另請參閱進階設定「自訂分頁標籤字型大小」。";
"Tabs: Use the running command's first letter as the tab's default icon if there isn't a built in one.\nThis takes effect when tabs are configured to use built-in icons." = "分頁： 當沒有內建圖示時，將正在執行的指令的首字母用作分頁的預設圖示。\n此設定在分頁設定為使用內建圖示時生效。";
"Tabs: Use “smart truncation” for tab titles.\nIf a tab‘s title is too long to fit, ellipsize the start of the title if more tabs have unique suffixes than prefixes in a given window." = "分頁： 對分頁標題使用「智慧截斷」。\n如果分頁標題過長無法容納，且在同一視窗中具有唯一後綴的分頁多於具有唯一前綴的分頁，則從標題開頭進行省略。";
"Tabs: Width of pinned tabs in pixels." = "分頁： 固定分頁的寬度（像素）。";
"Tags for organizing and filtering profiles" = "用於組織和篩選設定檔的標籤";
"Tags to filter available snippets" = "用於篩選可用程式碼片段的標籤";
"Template for log filename" = "日誌檔名範本";
"Terminal background color" = "終端背景顏色";
"Terminal background color in dark mode" = "終端背景顏色（深色模式）";
"Terminal background color in light mode" = "終端背景顏色（明亮模式）";
"Terminal type string reported to applications (e.g., xterm-256color)" = "回報給應用程式的終端類型字串（例如 xterm-256color）";
"Terminal: Accept OSC 7 to set username, hostname, and path." = "終端： 接受 OSC 7 以設定使用者名稱、主機名稱和路徑。";
"Terminal: Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds).\nThis is used by the password manager to ensure you're at a password prompt. Set to 0 to disable echo probe." = "終端： 測試回顯是否開啟的等待時間（秒）。\n密碼管理器使用此設定確保您處於密碼提示符處。設為 0 可停用回顯探測。";
"Terminal: Apps may turn on Focus Reporting.\nFocus reporting causes iTerm2 to send an escape sequence when a session gains or loses focus. It can cause problems when an ssh session dies unexpectedly because it gets left on, so some users prefer to disable it." = "終端： 應用可能會開啟焦點報告。\n焦點報告會導致 iTerm2 在工作階段獲得或失去焦點時傳送逸出序列。當 ssh 工作階段意外終止時可能會因此遺留開啟狀態而引發問題，因此某些使用者傾向於停用它。";
"Terminal: Automatically enable secure keyboard entry at password prompts?" = "終端： 在密碼提示符處自動啟用安全鍵盤輸入？";
"Terminal: Automatically silence bell when it rings too much." = "終端： 響鈴過於頻繁時自動靜音。";
"Terminal: Bounce dock icon when the bell rings while another app is active?" = "終端： 當其他應用處於活動狀態時響鈴是否使 Dock 圖示跳動？";
"Terminal: Command to run when handling an ssh:// URL." = "處理 ssh：// URL 時執行的指令。";
"Terminal: Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration, even when TERM matches *tmux*?\nThis was the default behavior for a long time, but it was incorrect. The conversion should only be done when TERM matches *screen*." = "終端： 在 tmux 整合中將斜體轉換為反白顯示，即使 TERM 匹配 *tmux*？\n這在很長一段時間內是預設行為，但並不正確。該轉換僅應在 TERM 匹配 *screen* 時進行。";
"Terminal: Convert italics to reverse video in tmux integration?\nThis is effective when the default TERM reported by tmux matches *screen*." = "終端： 在 tmux 整合中將斜體轉換為反白顯示？\n當 tmux 報告的預設 TERM 匹配 *screen* 時生效。";
"Terminal: Cursor blink speed (seconds)." = "終端： 游標閃爍速度（秒）。";
"Terminal: Cursor occupies line spacing area.\nIf lines have more than 100% vertical spacing and this setting is enabled the bottom of the cursor will be aligned to the bottom of the spacing area." = "終端： 游標佔據行間距區域。\n如果行垂直間距超過 100% 且此設定已啟用，游標底部將與間距區域底部對齊。";
"Terminal: Debug: highlight prompt mark prompt/command/excluded ranges in the legacy (non-GPU) renderer.\nWhen enabled, the legacy renderer overlays a blue outline around each visible prompt mark’s prompt range (OSC 133 A to B), a green outline around its command range (B to C), and a red outline around each excluded subrange (PS2 prefixes and right-prompt regions recorded via OSC 133 k=). Disable the Metal renderer (Settings → General → Magic) to see this. Intended for development and bug reports; leave off in normal use." = "終端： 除錯：在傳統（非 GPU）渲染器中高亮提示標記的提示符/命令/排除範圍。\n啟用後，傳統渲染器會在每個可見提示標記的提示符範圍（OSC 133 A 到 B）周圍覆蓋藍色輪廓，在其命令範圍（B 到 C）周圍覆蓋綠色輪廓，在每個排除子範圍（PS2 前綴和透過 OSC 133 k= 記錄的右側提示區域）周圍覆蓋紅色輪廓。停用 Metal 渲染器（設定 → 一般 → Magic）即可看到此效果。僅供開發和錯誤報告使用；正常使用時請關閉。";
"Terminal: Default tab stop width for new sessions.\nNote: this will break drawing in emacs and other apps." = "終端： 新工作階段的預設定位停駐點寬度。\n注意：這會破壞 emacs 及其他應用中的繪製。";
"Terminal: Disable animations for showing/hiding password manager." = "終端： 停用顯示/隱藏密碼管理器的動畫。";
"Terminal: Evaluate idempotent triggers periodically in interactive apps, even when triggers in interactive apps are disabled." = "終端： 在互動式應用中定期評估冪等觸發器，即使互動式應用中的觸發器已停用。";
"Terminal: How long (seconds) terminal echo must remain disabled before iTerm2 treats it as a password prompt.\nThis prevents shell scripts that briefly turn off echo (e.g. while reading the response to an OSC report request) from triggering the password manager. Set to 0 to disable debouncing." = "終端： 終端回顯必須保持停用多長時間（秒）iTerm2 才將其視為密碼提示符。\n這可防止短暫關閉回顯的 shell 指令稿（例如在讀取 OSC 報告請求的回應時）觸發密碼管理器。設為 0 可停用防抖。";
"Terminal: Initial alpha value when flashing the visual bell or search wraparound indicator" = "終端： 閃爍視覺響鈴或搜尋環繞指示器時的初始 alpha 值。";
"Terminal: Maximum length for OSC 8 URLs" = "終端： OSC 8 URL 的最大長度。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of chunks to buffer.\nIn general, these chunks are 1024 bytes. A larger value increases buffer bloat but—up to a limit—can improve performance in the fast path of ASCII text." = "終端： 緩衝的最大區塊數。\n通常這些區塊為 1024 位元組。較大的值會增加緩衝膨脹，但在一定限度內可以提升 ASCII 文字快速路徑的效能。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of lines of history to expose to Accessibility.\nAccessibility APIs can make iTerm2 slow. In order to limit the effect, you can restrict the number of lines in each session that are visible to accessibility. The last lines of each session will be made accessible." = "終端： 向輔助功能公開的歷史記錄最大行數。\n輔助功能 API 會使 iTerm2 變慢。為限制其影響，您可以限制每個工作階段中對輔助功能可見的行數。每個工作階段的最後幾行將被設為可存取。";
"Terminal: Maximum number of lines of history to restore.\nWhen the app is relaunched, only the last N lines of history are restored to avoid making launch too slow. If you reduce this number, existing sessions won't be affected until their history is cleared." = "終端： 恢復歷史記錄的最大行數。\n應用重新啟動時，僅恢復最後 N 行歷史記錄以避免啟動過慢。如果減小此數字，現有工作階段在清除歷史記錄之前不受影響。";
"Terminal: Minimum time between beeping or flashing screen on bell, in seconds.\nIf the time interval between bells is less than this amount of time, it will be ignored." = "終端： 響鈴時蜂鳴或閃爍螢幕之間的最小間隔時間（秒）。\n如果兩次響鈴之間的時間間隔小於此值，則會被忽略。";
"Terminal: Never set the CTYPE environment variable." = "終端： 永不設定 CTYPE 環境變數。";
"Terminal: Number of screen lines to match against trigger regular expressions.\nTrigger regular expressions are matched against the last logical line of text when a newline is received. A search is performed to find the start of the line. Since very long lines would cause performance problems, the search (and consequently the regular expression match, highlighting, and so on) is limited to this many screen lines." = "終端： 與觸發器正規表示式匹配的螢幕行數。\n當收到換行符時，觸發器正規表示式會與最後一個邏輯文字行進行匹配。會執行搜尋以查找行的起始位置。由於非常長的行會導致效能問題，搜尋（以及隨後的正規表示式匹配、高亮等）被限制在此螢幕行數以內。";
"Terminal: Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?\nThis is also known as the terminfo E3 capability." = "終端： 阻止 CSI 3 J 清除回捲歷史？\n這也稱為 terminfo E3 功能。";
"Terminal: Prevent control sequences from changing the current profile?" = "終端： 阻止控制序列更改當前設定檔？";
"Terminal: Regular expression for “Find URLs” command." = "「尋找 URL」指令的正規表示式。";
"Terminal: Restore window contents at startup.\nThis requires “System Settings > Desktop & Dock > Close windows when quitting an app” to be off." = "終端： 啟動時恢復視窗內容。\n這需要「系統設定 > 桌面與 Dock > 退出應用時關閉視窗」處於關閉狀態。";
"Terminal: Set $TERMINFO_DIRS to add modern terminal features to xterm-like $TERMs?\niTerm2 ships with extended terminfo capabilities for common TERMs (xterm, xterm-new, and xterm-256color). For example, it enables undercurl. New sessions get created with a TERMINFO_DIRS that make the customized TERMINFOs take precedence over the system defaults." = "終端： 設定 $TERMINFO_DIRS 以便為類 xterm 的 $TERM 新增現代終端功能？\niTerm2 內建了常見 TERM（xterm、xterm-new 和 xterm-256color）的擴展 terminfo 功能。例如，它啟用 undercurl。新工作階段建立時會帶有使自訂 TERMINFO 優先於系統預設值的 TERMINFO_DIRS。";
"Terminal: Show key at cursor at password prompt?" = "終端： 在密碼提示符處顯示游標處的按鍵？";
"Terminal: Support TERM=screen\nMost notably, this fixes italics replacing inverse text." = "終端： 支援 TERM=screen\n最顯著的是，這修復了斜體替換反白文字的問題。";
"Terminal: Tabs wrap around to the next line.\nThis is useful for preserving tabs for later copying to the pasteboard. It breaks backward compatibility and may cause layout problems with programs that don’t expect this behavior." = "終端： 定位字元換行到下一行。\n這有助於保留定位字元以便日後複製到剪貼板。它會破壞向後相容性，並可能導致不期望此行為的程式出現版面問題。";
"Terminal: Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for background color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s background color will always be the cell’s text color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "終端： 智慧游標顏色背景顏色的閾值（0 到 1）。\n0 表示游標背景顏色始終為儲存格的文字顏色，1 表示始終為黑色或白色。";
"Terminal: Threshold for Smart Cursor Color for text color (0 to 1).\n0 means the cursor’s text color will always be the cell’s background color, while 1 means it will always be black or white." = "終端： 智慧游標顏色文字顏色的閾值（0 到 1）。\n0 表示游標文字顏色始終為儲存格的背景顏色，1 表示始終為黑色或白色。";
"Terminal: To drag images or selected text, you must hold ⌘. This prevents accidental drags." = "終端： 要拖動圖像或選取的文字，必須按住 ⌘。這可防止意外拖動。";
"Terminal: Use P3 as default color space? If No, sRGB will be used." = "終端： 使用 P3 作為預設顏色空間？如果為「否」，則使用 sRGB。";
"Terminal: Use fallback for COLORFGBG if no exact match found?\nThe COLORFGBG variable indicates the ANSI colors that match the foreground and background colors. If no colors match and this setting is enabled, then the variable will be set to 15;0 to indicate a dark background or 0;15 to indicate a light background." = "終端： 未找到精確匹配時是否為 COLORFGBG 使用回退值？\nCOLORFGBG 變數指示與前景和背景顏色匹配的 ANSI 顏色。如果沒有顏色匹配且此設定已啟用，則該變數將設為 15；0 表示深色背景，或 0；15 表示淺色背景。";
"Terminal: Variables to report via control sequence\nThis is a comma-delimited list of variables that can be reported with the OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name control sequence. Each variable name must be prefixed with “allow:” or “deny:”." = "終端： 透過控制序列報告的變數\n這是一個以逗號分隔的變數列表，可透過 OSC 1337 ReportVariable=name 控制序列報告。每個變數名稱必須以「allow：」或「deny：」為前綴。";
"Terminal: Vertical offset for underline cursor.\nPositive values move it up, negative values move it down." = "終端： 底線游標的垂直偏移量。\n正值向上移動，負值向下移動。";
"Terminal: Visual bell flashes the whole screen, not just a bell icon." = "終端： 視覺響鈴閃爍整個螢幕，而不僅是響鈴圖示。";
"Terminal: Warn if the `open` command appears to fail when secure keyboard input is enabled?" = "終端： 當啟用安全鍵盤輸入時 `open` 指令似乎失敗是否警告？";
"Terminal: When evaluating idempotent triggers in interactive apps, wait this long (in seconds) between updates.\nThis limits the performance impact of trigger evaluation." = "終端： 在互動式應用中評估冪等觸發器時，更新之間等待的時長（秒）。\n這限制了觸發器評估對效能的影響。";
"Terminal: When files are dropped into a terminal window, execute a silent coprocess.\nThis is an interpolated string. Use \\(filenames) to reference the shell-quoted, space-delimited full paths to the dropped files. If this preference is empty, the filenames get pasted instead." = "終端： 當檔案被拖入終端視窗時，執行靜默協同程序。\n這是一個插值字串。使用 \\(filenames) 參照已 shell 轉義、空格分隔的拖入檔案完整路徑。如果此偏好為空，則改為貼上檔案名稱。";
"Terminal: When rendering natively, use wide mode by default?" = "終端： 原生繪製時預設使用寬模式？";
"Terminal: When using “Find URLs”, extend results across soft boundaries like tmux pane dividers." = "終端： 使用「尋找 URL」時，跨 tmux 分割窗格分隔符等軟邊界擴展結果。";
"Terminal: Width of vertical bar cursor." = "終端： 豎條游標的寬度。";
"Terminal: Zero-Width Space (U+200B) advances cursor?\nWhile a zero-width space should not advance the cursor per the Unicode spec, both Terminal.app and Konsole do this, and Weechat depends on it. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting." = "終端： 零寬空格 (U+200B) 推進游標？\n雖然根據 Unicode 規範零寬空格不應推進游標，但 Terminal.app 和 Konsole 都這樣做，且 Weechat 依賴此行為。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2。";
"Terminal: xterm version for secondary device attributes (SDA).\nIncreasing this number enables more features in apps but may break things. Use 95 to recover pre-3.4.10 behavior." = "終端： 用於輔助裝置屬性 (SDA) 的 xterm 版本。\n增大此數字可為應用啟用更多功能，但可能破壞某些功能。使用 95 可恢復 3.4.10 之前的行為。";
"Test Connection" = "測試連線";
"Testing…" = "測試中…";
"Text color of selected text" = "選取文字顏色";
"Text color of selected text in dark mode" = "選取文字顏色（深色模式）";
"Text color of selected text in light mode" = "選取文字顏色（明亮模式）";
"Text for composer" = "組合器文字";
"Text is sent when you activate Semantic History on any filename. Use vim-style special characters. Use \\1 for filename, \\2 for line number, \\3 for text before click, \\4 for text after click, \\5 for pwd. " = "當您在任意檔名上啟用語意歷史時傳送文字。使用 vim 風格的特殊字元。用 \\1 表示檔名，\\2 表示行號，\\3 表示點擊前的文字，\\4 表示點擊後的文字，\\5 表示工作目錄。 ";
"Text template for the badge overlay" = "徽章疊加文字範本";
"Text to send to session after shell starts" = "Shell 啟動後傳送至工作階段的文字";
"Text:" = "文字：";
"The chat’s title will replace it when speaking to the AI." = "與 AI 對話時，對話標題將取代它。";
"The existence of buried sessions disables opening a window at startup." = "存在埋藏的工作階段時會停用啟動時開啟視窗。";
"The existence of hotkey windows disables opening a window at startup." = "存在熱鍵視窗時會停用啟動時開啟視窗。";
"The presence of auto-launch scripts disables opening a window at startup." = "存在自動啟動腳本時會停用啟動時開啟視窗。";
"The prompt must contain the substring %@. %@" = "提示符必須包含子字串 %@。%@";
"The query you enter will replace it when speaking to the AI. For example: “Write a unix command to \\(ai.prompt).”" = "您輸入的查詢將在與 AI 對話時替換它。例如：“編寫一條 unix 命令來 \\(ai.prompt)。”";
"This panel helps you configure a new profile that will be bound to a keystroke you assign. Pressing the hotkey (even when iTerm2 is not active) will toggle a special window." = "此面板幫助您設定一個新設定檔，並將其綁定到您指定的按鍵。按下熱鍵（即使 iTerm2 未處於活動狀態）也會切換顯示一個特殊視窗。";
"Three-finger Swipe Down" = "三指下滑";
"Three-finger Swipe Left" = "三指左滑";
"Three-finger Swipe Right" = "三指右滑";
"Three-finger Swipe Up" = "三指上滑";
"Three-finger Tap" = "三指輕點";
"Tip of the Day: Disable the Tip of the Day?" = "每日提示： 停用每日提示？";
"Tip of the Day: Time between tips (in seconds)" = "每日提示： 提示之間的間隔時間（以秒為單位）";
"Title" = "標題";
"Title of tmux pane for edit session dialog" = "用於編輯工作階段對話框的 tmux 窗格標題";
"Tmux Integration: Close tmux windows after detaching?\nThis only takes effect when “Settings > Profiles > Session > After a session ends” is set to “No Action”." = "tmux 整合： 分離後關閉 tmux 視窗？\n這僅在「設定 > 設定檔 > 工作階段 > 工作階段結束後」設為「無動作」時生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Disable window position restoration in tmux integration." = "tmux 整合： 在 tmux 整合中停用視窗位置復原。";
"Tmux Integration: Don't automatically resize tmux windows" = "tmux 整合： 不要自動調整 tmux 視窗大小";
"Tmux Integration: Insert this string at the start of tab and window titles to indicate tmux integration." = "tmux 整合： 在分頁和視窗標題開頭插入此字串以指示 tmux 整合。";
"Tmux Integration: Open tmux windows and tabs in the background?\nWhen enabled, attaching with tmux -CC (or when tmux creates a new window) will reveal the window or tab without moving keyboard focus to it. Focus stays on the attaching session." = "tmux 整合： 在背景開啟 tmux 視窗和分頁？\n啟用時，使用 tmux -CC 連接（或 tmux 建立新視窗時）會顯示視窗或分頁，但不會將鍵盤焦點移至其上。焦點保持在連接工作階段上。";
"Tmux Integration: Poll for foreground job name in tmux integration with tmux < 3.2?\nThis enables tab icons but can cause a lot of background traffic. This has no effect in tmux 3.2 and later, where polling is unnecessary." = "tmux 整合： 在 tmux < 3.2 的 tmux 整合中輪詢前台作業名稱？\n這會啟用分頁圖示，但可能產生大量背景流量。在 tmux 3.2 及更高版本中無效，因為無需輪詢。";
"Tmux Integration: Remember window sizes in tmux integration?\nRequires tmux 2.9 or later. The “variable window size” advanced setting must be enabled." = "tmux 整合： 在 tmux 整合中記住視窗大小？\n需要 tmux 2.9 或更高版本。必須啟用「可變視窗大小」進階設定。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of tab to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "tmux 整合： 隱藏詢問在 tmux 整合中開啟何種分頁的警告。\n注意：僅在現已棄用的「隱藏詢問在 tmux 整合中開啟何種分頁/視窗的警告」設定關閉時才生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration. Affects both windows and tabs.\nThis setting predates having separate settings for windows vs tabs. If it is off, then the two new settings will take effect." = "tmux 整合： 隱藏詢問在 tmux 整合中開啟何種分頁/視窗的警告。同時影響視窗和分頁。\n此設定早於視窗與分頁的獨立設定。如果關閉，則兩個新設定將生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Suppress alert asking what kind of window to open in tmux integration.\nNOTE: This only takes effect if the now-deprecated “Suppress alert asking what kind of tab/window to open in tmux integration” setting is off." = "tmux 整合： 隱藏詢問在 tmux 整合中開啟何種視窗的警告。\n注意：僅在現已棄用的「隱藏詢問在 tmux 整合中開啟何種分頁/視窗的警告」設定關閉時才生效。";
"Tmux Integration: Tolerate unrecognized commands from server.\nIf disabled, an unknown command from tmux (such as output from ssh or wall) will end the session. Turning this off helps detect dead ssh sessions." = "tmux 整合： 容忍來自伺服器的未識別命令。\n如果停用，來自 tmux 的未知命令（如 ssh 或 wall 的輸出）將結束工作階段。關閉此項有助於偵測已失效的 ssh 工作階段。";
"Tmux Integration: Use black for filler area in tmux windows in full screen." = "tmux 整合： 全螢幕下 tmux 視窗的填充區域使用黑色。";
"Tmux Integration: When using tmux integration, should the tmux client name (typically the name of the attaching session or the host name) appear in brackets in the window title?" = "tmux 整合： 使用 tmux 整合時，tmux 客戶端名稱（通常是連接工作階段的名稱或主機名）是否應顯示在視窗標題的方括號中？";
"Tmux Integration: Where should new tmux windows not created by iTerm2 open?\n“Focused window” (the default) attaches the window as a tab of whichever iTerm2 window currently has keyboard focus. “Topmost session window” attaches it to the frontmost iTerm2 window that already shows a tab from this tmux session, regardless of focus." = "tmux 整合： 非 iTerm2 建立的新 tmux 視窗應在哪裡開啟？\n「目前焦點視窗」（預設）將視窗作為分頁附加到目前擁有鍵盤焦點的 iTerm2 視窗。「最前面的工作階段視窗」將其附加到已顯示該 tmux 工作階段分頁的最前面的 iTerm2 視窗，無論焦點如何。";
