"Warnings: Always turn off mouse reporting when host changes?" = "警告： 主機更改時始終關閉滑鼠報告？";
"Warnings: Always turn off paste bracketing when host changes?" = "警告： 主機更改時始終關閉貼上括號？";
"Warnings: Disable control sequence to open URLs?" = "警告： 停用開啟 URL 的控制序列？";
"Warnings: Open links using the in-app browser?" = "警告： 使用應用程式內瀏覽器開啟連結？";
"Warnings: Send Clear Session to all broadcasted-to sessions?" = "警告： 向所有廣播目標工作階段傳送「清除工作階段」？";
"Warnings: Suppress a warning about a change to a Profile key setting that overrides a global setting." = "警告： 隱藏關於設定檔按鍵設定更改覆寫全域設定的警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress a warning about a change to a global key that's overridden by a Profile." = "警告： 隱藏關於被設定檔覆寫的全域按鍵更改的警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress a warning about how to configure Spaces when setting a window's Space." = "警告： 隱藏關於設定視窗 Space 時如何配置 Spaces 的警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress a warning when ⌥ Key Acts as Meta is enabled in Settings > Profiles > Keys." = "警告： 當在「設定 > 設定檔 > 按鍵」中按鍵」中啟用「⌥ 鍵作為 Meta」時隱藏警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress announcement that tmux will pause a session." = "警告： 隱藏 tmux 將暫停工作階段的通告。";
"Warnings: Suppress changed-setting warning when settings are loaded from a URL." = "警告： 從 URL 載入設定時隱藏設定已更改的警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress changed-setting warning when settings are loaded from a custom folder." = "警告： 從自訂資料夾載入設定時隱藏設定已更改的警告。";
"Warnings: Suppress confirmation to remove annotation?" = "警告： 隱藏移除註解的確認？";
"Warnings: Suppress kill/hide dialog when closing a tmux tab." = "警告： 關閉 tmux 分頁時隱藏終止/隱藏對話框。";
"Warnings: Suppress kill/hide dialog when closing a tmux window." = "警告： 關閉 tmux 視窗時隱藏終止/隱藏對話框。";
"Warnings: Suppress offer to silence bell when it rings too much." = "警告： 隱藏響鈴過於頻繁時靜音響鈴的提議。";
"Warnings: Suppress the browser plugin upsell when clicking links?" = "警告： 點擊連結時隱藏瀏覽器外掛程式推銷？";
"Warnings: Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable mouse reporting that is shown after a drag followed by Cmd-C when mouse reporting is on?" = "警告： 隱藏在滑鼠報告啟用時拖曳後按 Cmd-C 詢問是否要停用滑鼠報告的通知？";
"Warnings: Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable resize reporting" = "警告： 隱藏詢問是否要停用調整大小報告的通知";
"Warnings: Suppress the notification that a restored session’s profile no longer exists?" = "警告： 隱藏復原的工作階段的設定檔已不存在的通知？";
"Warnings: Suppress the notification that a saved arrangement has a bad initial working directory." = "警告： 隱藏已儲存的配置的初始工作目錄無效的通知。";
