"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nOpen files in new windows, not new tabs or split panes.\nThis affects shell scripts opened from Finder, for example. See also “Open files in split panes”." = "視窗： 已棄用：請改用「新實例應如何開啟」。\n在新視窗中開啟檔案，而不是新分頁或分割分割窗格。\n例如，這會影響從 Finder 開啟的 shell 腳本。另請參閱「在分割分割窗格中開啟檔案」。";
"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nWhen opening a file in a split pane, should it be a vertical split?" = "視窗： 已棄用：請改用「新實例應如何開啟」。\n在分割分割窗格中開啟檔案時，是否應為垂直分割？";
"Windows: Dark themes give terminal windows black title bars by default." = "視窗： 深色主題預設為終端視窗提供黑色標題列。";
"Windows: Disable documented edited indicator (black dot in close button)" = "視窗： 停用已記錄的已編輯指示器（關閉按鈕中的黑點）";
"Windows: Disable the window shadow on High Sierra and earlier when the window has a transparent session to prevent text shadows." = "視窗： 在 High Sierra 及更早版本上當視窗包含透明工作階段時停用視窗陰影以防止文字陰影。";
"Windows: Disable the window shadow on Mojave when the window has a transparent session to improve performance." = "視窗： 在 Mojave 上當視窗包含透明工作階段時停用視窗陰影以提升效能。";
"Windows: How should new instances be opened when triggered by scripts or external applications?\n-1: Use legacy settings (default)\n0: New Window\n1: New Tab\n2: Vertical Split Pane\n3: Horizontal Split Pane\nThis provides a unified setting for controlling external instance creation." = "視窗： 由腳本或外部應用程式觸發時，新實例應如何開啟？\n-1： 使用舊版設定（預設）\n0： 新視窗\n1： 新分頁\n2： 垂直分割分割窗格\n3： 水平分割分割窗格\n這提供了一個用於控制外部實例建立的統一設定。";
"Windows: If the Profiles window is open, it always moves to join the active Space.\nYou must restart iTerm2 for a change in this setting to take effect." = "視窗： 如果「設定檔」視窗已開啟，它總是移動到目前活躍的 Space。\n你必須重啟 iTerm2 此設定的更改才會生效。";
"Windows: Include keyboard shortcut for windows in Window menu?" = "視窗： 在「視窗」選單中包含視窗的鍵盤快捷鍵？";
"Windows: Left-align title bar in Minimal and Compact themes in macOS 26 and later?" = "視窗： 在 macOS 26 及更高版本中，Minimal 和 Compact 主題下左對齊標題列？";
"Windows: Opaque windows have a border only in light mode.\nThis setting modifies “Show border around windows”. Borders in opaque windows in dark mode are ugly and the OS draws one that is pretty serviceable. Enable this if you have trouble seeing them." = "視窗： 不透明視窗僅在明亮模式下顯示邊框。\n此設定修改「在視窗周圍顯示邊框」。深色模式下不透明視窗的邊框很難看，而系統繪製的邊框相當實用。如果你難以看到邊框，請啟用此項。";
"Windows: Should growing or shrinking the font in a session that's broadcasting input affect all session that broadcast input?\nThis only applies to changing the font size with Make Text Bigger, Make Text Normal Size, and Make Text Smaller" = "視窗： 在廣播輸入的工作階段中放大或縮小字型時，是否應影響所有廣播輸入的工作階段？\n這僅適用於透過「放大文字」、「恢復正常文字大小」和「縮小文字」更改字型大小。";
"Windows: Show secure keyboard entry indicator?" = "視窗： 顯示安全鍵盤輸入指示器？";
"Windows: Show window number in titlebar accessory?" = "視窗： 在標題列附件中顯示視窗編號？";
"Windows: Show window title when the tab bar is not visible?\nWhen disabled, the tab's title will be shown where the window title would normally go." = "視窗： 分頁列不可見時顯示視窗標題？\n停用時，分頁的標題會顯示在視窗標題通常所在的位置。";
"Windows: Simulated notch height" = "視窗： 模擬刘海高度";
"Windows: Terminal windows resize smoothly.\nDisables snapping to character grid. Holding Control will temporarily disable snap-to-grid." = "視窗： 終端視窗平滑調整大小。\n停用對齊到字元網格。按住 Control 可臨時停用網格對齊。";
"Windows: Toolbelt font family name" = "視窗： 工具列字型族名稱";
"Windows: Toolbelt font size in points.\nSet to 0 to use the system default. Changing this setting does not affect existing windows." = "視窗： 工具列字型大小（以點為單位）。\n設為 0 則使用系統預設值。更改此設定不影響現有視窗。";
"Windows: Use a tracking runloop for live resizing.\nThis allows the terminal to redraw during a resizing drag." = "視窗： 使用追蹤 runloop 實現即時調整大小。\n這允許終端在拖曳調整大小期間重繪。";
"Windows: When opening multiple fullscreen windows, enter fullscreen one window at a time." = "視窗： 開啟多個全螢幕視窗時，逐一進入全螢幕。";
"Windows: When restoring a window arrangement, ensure windows are entirely within the bounds of the current displays." = "視窗： 復原視窗配置時，確保視窗完全位於目前顯示器的邊界內。";
"Windows: Width (in points) reserved for the window buttons (close/minimize/zoom) before the inline tab bar.\nThe default is 75. Reduce it to move tab content closer to the buttons, or increase it for more breathing room. This only takes effect for the Compact and Minimal themes when the tab bar is visible and located at the top of the window. Setting it smaller than the buttons themselves will let tabs overlap them." = "視窗： 內聯分頁列之前為視窗按鈕（關閉/最小化/縮放）保留的寬度（以點為單位）。\n預設值為 75。減小它可使分頁內容更靠近按鈕，增大它可留出更多空間。這僅在 Compact 和 Minimal 主題下、分頁列可見且位於視窗頂部時生效。設定為小於按鈕本身寬度時，分頁會與按鈕重疊。";
"Windows: Windows have square corners.\nThis is only for users who have already hacked macOS to remove rounded corners. You must restart iTerm2 after changing this setting for it to take effect." = "視窗： 視窗為直角。\n這僅適用於已透過 hack 移除 macOS 圓角的使用者。更改此設定後必須重啟 iTerm2 才能生效。";
"Windows: Work around a macOS bug where the OS moves windows to the first display for no good reason." = "視窗： 規避一個 macOS bug，該 bug 會導致系統無端將視窗移動到第一個顯示器。";
"Working directory option for new split panes" = "新分割窗格的工作目錄選項";
"Working directory option for new tabs" = "新分頁的工作目錄選項";
"Working directory option for new windows" = "新視窗的工作目錄選項";
