"Dry-run mode is enabled. iTerm2 will log to Console.app what it would erase and stay running. Nothing will actually be deleted." = "已啟用試執行模式。iTerm2 將在 Console.app 中記錄本會抹掉的內容並繼續執行。實際上不會刪除任何內容。";
"Dry-Run Erase?" = "試執行抹掉？";
"Run Dry Run" = "執行試執行";
"The following will be erased and iTerm2 will quit immediately:\n\n• Preferences (profiles, key bindings, arrangements, advanced settings)\n• Saved windows and sessions\n• Python API scripts and runtimes\n• Secure settings\n• The contents of ~/.iterm2 and ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2\n\nItems stored in the macOS Keychain (such as the AI API key and Password Manager entries) are not erased and must be removed manually from Keychain Access if you want them gone too. On systems with networked home directories, secure settings stored under /usr/local are written by an administrator and may also need to be removed manually.\n\nThis cannot be undone." = "以下內容將被抹掉，iTerm2 將立即結束：\n\n• 偏好設定（設定檔、按鍵綁定、視窗排列、進階設定）\n• 已儲存的視窗和會話\n• Python API 腳本和執行環境\n• 安全設定\n• ~/.iterm2 和 ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2 的內容\n\n儲存在 macOS 鑰匙圈中的項目（如 AI API 金鑰和密碼管理器條目）不會被抹掉，如果你也想刪除它們，必須在「鑰匙圈存取」中手動移除。在使用網路主目錄的系統上，儲存在 /usr/local 下的安全設定由管理員寫入，可能也需要手動移除。\n\n此動作無法復原。";
