"Triggers watch for text matching a regular expression to arrive in a terminal session and then perform an action in response." = "觸發器監視終端機工作階段中到達的與規則表示式匹配的文字，然後執行回應動作。";
"URL schemes handled by profile" = "設定檔處理的 URL 方案";
"Undo close session timeout" = "復原關閉工作階段逾時";
"User" = "使用者";
"Vertical spacing" = "垂直間距";
"Window height in percentage of screen height" = "視窗高度佔螢幕高度的百分比";
"Window height in pixels" = "視窗高度（像素）";
"Window height in rows" = "視窗高度（列）";
"Window style for new windows" = "新視窗的視窗樣式";
"Window width in columns" = "視窗寬度（欄）";
"Window width in percentage of screen width" = "視窗寬度佔螢幕寬度的百分比";
"Window width in pixels" = "視窗寬度（像素）";
"You have chosen to have an option key act as Meta. This option is useful for backward compatibility with older systems. The \"Esc+\" option is recommended for most users." = "您已選擇讓 Option 鍵用作 Meta。此選項用於與舊系統的向下相容。對於大多數使用者，推薦使用「Esc+」選項。";
"bell" = "鈴聲";
