"new output" = "新輸出";
"open file" = "開啟檔案";
"open url" = "開啟 URL";
"regex" = "規則";
"regular expression" = "規則表示式";
"session ended" = "工作階段結束";
"No deletable color presets." = "沒有可刪除的顏色預設。";
"You cannot erase the built-in presets and no custom presets have been imported." = "無法刪除內建設定，且尚未匯入自訂預設。";
"Select a preset to delete:" = "選擇要刪除的預設：";
"Save Failed." = "儲存失敗。";
"Apply to current session" = "套用到目前工作階段";
"Apply to all sessions" = "套用到所有工作階段";
"Apply to all sessions except current" = "套用到除目前外所有工作階段";
"Apply to all sessions in window" = "套用到視窗中所有工作階段";
"Apply to all sessions in tab" = "套用到分頁中所有工作階段";
"Apply to broadcasted-to sessions" = "套用到廣播目標工作階段";
"Could not save to %@" = "無法儲存到%@";
"Factory Defaults" = "工廠預設值";
"When a session is archived, a full-fidelity copy of it gets saved to disk. You can view archives under the menu item Shell > Archives." = "階段封存时，会将其完整保真的副本儲存到磁碟。可以在“Shell > 封存”選單项下檢視封存。";
"When enabled, anything you type just after creating a session with this profile will be stored to be sent later. In order to stop buffering, you may either select the menu item Shell > Toggle Buffer Input, or you can add a Trigger with the action “Buffer Input…” configured to “Stop Buffering Input” to allow buffered input to be sent and keyboard interaction to work normally." = "啟用后，使用此設定檔建立階段后立即輸入的任何内容都会被暫存起来，稍后傳送。要停止緩衝，可以选择“Shell > 切換緩衝輸入”選單项，也可以加入一个“緩衝輸入…”操作并配置为“停止緩衝輸入”的觸發器，让緩衝的輸入被傳送、鍵盤互動恢復正常。";
"Some key reporting modes support additional modifiers of Hyper, Meta, and Super.\n\nA key mapped to one Hyper, Meta, or Super will work normally when the current key reporting mode does not support extended modifiers.\n\nRefer to the manuals for individual applications to see if they support these modifiers and how to configure them." = "某些按鍵上报模式支持 Hyper、Meta 和 Super 附加修飾鍵。\n\n對映到 Hyper、Meta 或 Super 的按鍵，在当前按鍵上报模式不支持扩展修飾鍵时将正常工作。\n\n请参阅各个应用的手册，了解它们是否支持这些修飾鍵以及如何配置。";
"Any session will switch to this profile automatically when your hostname, username, and current path match one of the rules specified in the adjacent table.\n\nA rule may specify a username, hostname, path, or job. It can also specify combinations of them.\n\nFor example:\n\n * `user@host:/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\nHostnames, paths, and jobs may use `*` wildcards. When a rule that had matched no longer matches (e.g., because the hostname changes), the profile switches back. You can prevent that by adding `!` at the end of the rule. For example, `user@example.com!`.\n\nSee the [documentation](https://iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html) for all the details." = "当你的主機名稱、使用者名稱和当前路徑匹配相鄰表格中的某条規則时，任何階段都会自動切換到此設定檔。\n\n一条規則可以指定使用者名稱、主機名稱、路徑或作業，也可以指定它们的组合。\n\n例如：\n\n * `user@host：/path`\n * `user@`\n * `host`\n * `/path`\n * `&job`\n\n主機名稱、路徑和作業可以使用 `*` 萬用字元。当已匹配的規則不再匹配时（例如主機名稱发生了变化），設定檔会切換回去。在規則末尾加入 `!` 可以阻止这种行為。例如：`user@example.com!`。\n\n详情请参阅[文件](https：//iterm2.com/automatic-profile-switching.html)。";
"While this session has keyboard focus, the available Snippets will be limited to those containing all the tags listed in this field." = "此階段拥有鍵盤焦點时，可用的程式碼片段将仅限于包含此欄位中列出的全部標籤的那些片段。";
"When you double-click in the terminal, a single word is selected. When your click is on a letter, the word boundary is found by grouping letters adjacent to the click location. You can extend the set of characters that are treated as belonging to a word with this setting.\n\nFor example, if `/` is considered part of a word, then double clicking on a path would select all the path components.\n\nYou can choose to define the characters considered part of a word with a regular expression. Then you can add specific substrings, such as `https://`, if you would prefer double-clicks on URLs to include the scheme. Generally the regular expression you provide will be a sequence of alternates separated by `|`." = "在终端中雙擊会選取一个單字。当你的點按落在字母上时，会通过将与點按位置相鄰的字母分组来找到單字边界。你可以通过此设置擴充被視為單字組成部分的字元集合。\n\n例如，如果 `/` 被視為單字的一部分，那么雙擊路徑时会選取路徑的所有組成部分。\n\n你也可以选择用正規表示式来定义被視為單字組成部分的字元。之后还可以加入特定子字串，例如 `https：//`，这样雙擊 URL 时就会包含通訊協定開頭。通常，你提供的正規表示式是由 `|` 分隔的多个候選项组成的序列。";
"When enabled, modifiers are remapped in a way that affects system shortcuts and third-party apps that receive keystrokes in the background. For example, if you remap the  ⌥ to ⌘ and **Remap modifiers globally** is enabled then you could press ⌥-Tab to switch apps." = "啟用后，修飾鍵的重新對映方式会影響系统快捷键以及在後台接收按鍵的第三方应用。例如，如果你将 ⌥ 重新對映为 ⌘，且**全域重新對映修飾鍵**已啟用，那么你就可以按 ⌥-Tab 来切換应用。";
"Tabs: Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in light mode." = "分頁： 淺色模式下，非極簡主題中未選中分頁的暗度（範圍為 [0…1]）。";
"Tabs: Darkness (in [0…1]) for non-selected tabs in non-Minimal theme in dark mode." = "分頁： 深色模式下，非極簡主題中未選中分頁的暗度（範圍為 [0…1]）。";
"Mouse: Scroll wheel up sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "滑鼠： 替用螢幕模式下向上滾動滾輪時傳送指定文字。\n該值應使用 Vim 語法，例如 \\e 表示 escape。";
"Mouse: Scroll wheel down sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\e for escape." = "滑鼠： 替用螢幕模式下向下滾動滾輪時傳送指定文字。\n該值應使用 Vim 語法，例如 \\e 表示 escape。";
"Windows: DEPRECATED: Use “How should new instances be opened” instead.\nOpen files in split panes.\nThis affects shell scripts opened from Finder, for example. You must set “Open files in new windows, not new tabs” to “No” for this to take effect. See also “When opening a file in a split pane, should it be a vertical split?”" = "視窗： 已棄用： 請改用「新實例應如何開啟」。\n在分割窗格中開啟檔案。\n例如，這會影響從 Finder 開啟的 shell 指令碼。必須將「在新視窗而非新分頁中開啟檔案」設為「否」此項才能生效。另請參閱「在分割窗格中開啟檔案時，是否垂直分割？」。";
"Pasteboard: Separator inserted between multiple clippings when sending or copying them.\nThe value should use Vim syntax, such as \\n for newline and \\e for escape." = "剪貼板： 傳送或複製多個剪貼內容時在它們之間插入的分隔符。\n該值應使用 Vim 語法，例如 \\n 表示換行、\\e 表示 escape。";
"Pasteboard: Delay in seconds before the Return that submits an auto-sent code review.\nWhen the code-review workgroup toolbar auto-sends review results to the main session, it pastes the results and then sends a Return to submit them. This is how long it waits, after the pasted results finish, before sending that Return. A paste-debouncing TUI (such as Claude Code) processes a paste and a Return that arrive together as one batch, so the Return can be swallowed and the review never submits; the delay makes the Return land in a later read so it submits. The default matches Claude Code’s 500 ms paste-settling window. Set to 0 to send it immediately." = "剪貼板： 自動傳送的程式碼審查結果在提交回車前的延遲（以秒為單位）。\n當程式碼審查工具列把審查結果自動傳送到主工作階段時，會先貼上結果，再傳送一個回車來提交。這是指貼上完成後等待多久才傳送該回車。具有貼上防抖功能的 TUI（如 Claude Code）會把一起到達的貼上和回車當作同一批處理，導致回車被吞掉、審查無法提交；此延遲讓回車落在稍後的讀取中，從而成功提交。預設值對應 Claude Code 的 500 毫秒貼上穩定視窗。設為 0 表示立即傳送。";
"Quad-click selects a string under the cursor that best matches a regular expression from a collection of rules." = "四擊会選取游標下方与一組規則中的正規表示式最匹配的字符串。";
"⌘-Click on a filename referring to an existing file performs an action on that file." = "⌘-點按一个指向已存在檔案的檔案名稱时，会对该檔案執行相應操作。";
"Experimental Features: SSH URLs respect the path.\nThey run the command: ssh -t \\\"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\\\$SHELL -l\\\"" = "實驗性功能: SSH URL 遵循路徑。\n它們會執行命令:ssh -t \\\"cd $$PATH$$; exec \\\\$SHELL -l\\\"";
"%@ color" = "%@ 顏色";
"Custom color for bold text" = "粗體文字自訂顏色";
"Brighten bold text" = "調亮粗體文字";
"Color presets" = "顏色預設集";
"Set API key for AI" = "設定 AI 的 API 金鑰";
"AI Plugin" = "AI 外掛模組";
"AI default provider" = "AI 預設供應商";
"AI manual model default" = "AI 手動模型預設值";
"Manual model" = "手動模型";
"This action lets you exempt a keystroke from modifier remapping. For example, if you remap ⌘ to ⌥ but you want ⌘-Tab to work as though ⌘ were unmapped just for that keystroke, you would use this action and set the keyboard shortcut to ⌘-Tab" = "此動作可將某個按鍵排除在修飾鍵重映射之外。例如,若你將 ⌘ 重映射為 ⌥,但仍希望 ⌘-點按的行為如同 ⌘,可在此按鍵上使用此動作。";
"This action applies modifier remapping but prevents other programs from seeing the keystroke. For example, if you've swapped ⌘ and ^ and want physical ^-tab to switch tabs in iTerm2 instead of triggering the app switcher: bind ^-tab to this action. The system won't see the remapped ⌘-tab (so no app switcher), but iTerm2 receives it and can switch tabs." = "此動作套用修飾鍵重映射,但阻止其它程式看到該按鍵。例如,若你將 ⌘ 重映射為 ⌥,macOS 將看到 ⌥ 而其它程式不會收到任何按鍵。";
"Prevents the keystroke from being sent to the terminal while allowing macOS to handle it normally. For example, if F1 triggers a  macOS Shortcut, binding F1 to Bypass Terminal stops it from sending a control sequence to the terminal but still lets the system shortcut work." = "阻止該按鍵被傳送到終端機,同時允許 macOS 正常處理它。例如,⌘-C 仍會拷貝,但不會傳送 ^C。";
"Prevents the keystroke from having any effect within iTerm2. Modifier remapping remains unaffected." = "阻止該按鍵在 iTerm2 內產生任何效果。修飾鍵重映射不受影響。";
"Switches tabs in most-recently-used order, like ⌘-Tab in macOS. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk back through tab history; release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the previously-selected tab, so binding this to a plain key acts as a toggle between the two most recent tabs." = "按最近使用順序切換分頁,類似 macOS 的 ⌘-Tab。按住修飾鍵並反覆點按可在列表中向後移動。";
"Switches tabs in reverse most-recently-used order. Hold a modifier and tap repeatedly to walk forward through tab history (oldest first); release the modifier to commit your selection. A single tap with no modifier held jumps to the least-recently-used tab." = "按最近使用順序的反序切換分頁。按住修飾鍵並反覆點按可在列表中向前移動。";
"Enter copy mode commands to move cursor, toggle selection, and so on. This key binding enters Copy Mode and then acts as though you had pressed the keys listed here. [See a list of all the commands](https://iterm2.com/documentation-copymode.html). Use vim syntax for control, option, and function keys (e.g., `<C-x>` or `<Up>`." = "輸入 copy mode 命令來移動游標、切換選取範圍等。此按鍵綁定進入 Copy Mode 並執行你輸入的命令。";
"You can use this to copy information about the current session to the clipboard. [Learn more about interpolated strings](https://iterm2.com/documentation-scripting-fundamentals.html)" = "你可以用它將目前工作階段的資訊拷貝到剪貼簿。[了解有關工作階段插值字串的更多資訊](https://iterm2.com/documentation/interpolation.html)。";
"When set, the trigger fires only for the workgroup leader (the session that originally entered the workgroup). Peers such as the Code Review and Diff sessions do not, so reloading or quitting one keeps the workgroup open." = "設定後,觸發器僅對工作群組領導者(最初進入該工作群組的工作階段)生效。";
"C-Style Backslash Escaping supports: \\a (bell), \\b (backspace), \\e (escape), \n (newline), \\r (carriage return), \\t (tab), \\ (backslash), and \\x followed by two hex digits giving a single byte of UTF-8.\n\nUnescaped Literal Text does not have any special characters.\n\nBackward Compatibility Escaping, which is not recommended for new snippets, supports: \n (newline), \\e (escape), \\a (bell), and \\t (tab).\n\n" = "C 風格反斜線跳脫支援:\\a(響鈴)、\\b(退格)、\\e(escape)、\\n(換行)、\\r(歸位)、\\t(定位鍵)、\\\\(反斜線),以及 \\x 後跟兩個十六進位數字表示一個 UTF-8 位元組。\n\n未跳脫的字面文字不含任何特殊字元。\n\n向後相容跳脫(不建議用於新 snippet)支援:\\n(換行)、\\e(escape)、\\a(響鈴)和 \\t(定位鍵)。\n\n";
"Special characters are:\n* \\<1-to-3-digit octal>\n* \\x<1 or 2 digit hex>\n* \\u<4 digit hex>\n* \\b for backspace\n* \\e for esc\n* \\f for formfeed\n* \\n for newline and \\r for return\n* \\t for tab\n* \\\\ and \\\" for literal \\ and \"\n* <C-x> for control key\n* <M-x> for meta key." = "特殊字元包括:\n* \\<1 到 3 位八進位>\n* \\x<1 或 2 位十六進位>\n* \\u<4 位十六進位>\n* \\b 表示退格\n* \\e 表示 escape\n* \\n 表示換行";
"The following will be erased and iTerm2 will quit immediately:\n\n\\u{2022} Preferences (profiles, key bindings, arrangements, advanced settings)\n\\u{2022} Saved windows and sessions\n\\u{2022} Python API scripts and runtimes\n\\u{2022} Secure settings\n\\u{2022} The contents of ~/.iterm2 and ~/Library/Application Support/iTerm2\n\nItems stored in the macOS Keychain (such as the AI API key and Password Manager entries) are not erased and must be removed manually from Keychain Access if you want them gone too. On systems with networked home directories, secure settings stored under /usr/local are written by an administrator and may also need to be removed manually.\n\nThis cannot be undone." = "以下內容將被抹掉且 iTerm2 將立即結束:\n\n• 偏好設定(設定檔、按鍵綁定等)\n• 視窗排列\n• 工具帶設定\n• 片段(snippets)\n• 全域備忘\n• 分頁顏色\n\n此操作無法復原。";
"The selected profile, “%@”, is a dynamic profile. These are generally only edited by hand.\n\niTerm2 is now able to write changes back to dynamic profiles when they are marked as “rewritable“. Rewriting can cause the order of values to change." = "所選設定檔「%@」是動態設定檔。這類設定檔通常只能手動編輯。\n\niTerm2 現在可以將動態設定檔儲存到其資料夾中。要允許編輯它嗎?";
"This will repair %d key binding that was corrupted by a bug in an earlier version of iTerm2. The affected binding currently displays incorrectly but functions properly. After repair, it will display correctly.\n\nAffected key binding:\n%@" = "此操作將修復 %d 個被早期版本 iTerm2 的缺陷損壞的按鍵綁定。受影響的按鍵綁定將恢復為預設值。";
"This will repair %d key bindings that were corrupted by a bug in an earlier version of iTerm2. The affected bindings currently display incorrectly but function properly. After repair, they will display correctly.\n\nAffected key bindings:\n%@" = "此操作將修復 %d 個被早期版本 iTerm2 的缺陷損壞的按鍵綁定。受影響的按鍵綁定將恢復為預設值。";
"You must install the following fonts to use the exceptions in this file:\n\n%@" = "使用此檔案中的例外項必須安裝以下字體:\n\n%@";
"Default tab bar height\\nThis does not affect the minimal or compact themes. On macOS 26 Tahoe-style tabs, the top (horizontal) tab bar uses the system height and ignores this setting; left/right (vertical) tabs use max(26, this value) for each tab’s height." = "預設標籤欄高度\\n這不影響極簡或緊湊主題。在 macOS 26 Tahoe 風格的索引標籤中，頂部（水平）標籤欄使用系統高度並忽略此設定；左側/右側（垂直）索引標籤的每頁高度使用 max(26, 此值)。";
"Scroll wheel up sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\\n" = "替代螢幕模式下，向上捲動滾輪會傳送指定文字。\\n";
"Scroll wheel down sends the specified text when in alternate screen mode.\\n" = "替代螢幕模式下，向下捲動滾輪會傳送指定文字。\\n";
"Scroll wheel sends arrow keys when in alternate screen mode." = "替代螢幕模式下滾輪傳送方向鍵。";
"Regular expression for “Find URLs” command." = "「尋找 URL」命令的正規表示式。";
"Amount of time to wait while testing if echo is on (seconds).\\nThis is used by the password manager to ensure you're at a password prompt. Set to 0 to disable echo probe." = "偵測回顯是否開啟時的等待時間（秒）。\\n密碼管理器用它來確認您正處於密碼提示符號。設為 0 可停用回顯探測。";
"Prevent CSI 3 J from clearing scrollback history?\\nThis is also known as the terminfo E3 capability." = "是否阻止 CSI 3 J 清除回溯歷史？\\n這也稱為 terminfo E3 能力。";
"Prevent control sequences from changing the current profile?" = "是否阻止控制序列變更目前設定檔？";
"Disable DECRQCRA?\\nThis control sequence allows an app running in the terminal to read its contents." = "是否停用 DECRQCRA？\\n此控制序列允許終端機中執行的程式讀取終端機內容。";
"Timeout in seconds when running git for the status bar component." = "狀態列元件執行 git 的逾時時間（秒）。";
"Show FPS meter\\nRequires Metal renderer" = "顯示 FPS 計\\n需要 Metal 渲染器";
"Suppress the Restart Session offer.\\nWhen a session terminates, it will offer to restart itself. Turn this on to suppress the offer permanently." = "抑制「重新啟動工作階段」提議。\\n工作階段終止時會提議重新啟動自身。開啟此項可永久抑制該提議。";
"Format for automatic session log filenames.\\nSee the Badges documentation for supported substitutions." = "自動工作階段記錄檔檔名的格式。\\n支援的替換項請參見徽章文件。";
"Show secure keyboard entry indicator?" = "顯示安全鍵盤輸入指示器？";
"Suppress warning “Shell Integration is required for Capture Output.”" = "抑制警告「擷取輸出需要 Shell 整合。」";
"Suppress warning that the Captured Output tool is not visible." = "抑制「擷取輸出工具不可見」警告。";
"Suppress warning about multi-line pastes (or a single line ending in a newline).\\nThis applies whether you are at the shell prompt or not, provided two or more lines are being pasted." = "抑制多行貼上（或以換行符結尾的單行貼上）警告。\\n無論您是否處於 shell 提示符號，只要貼上兩行或以上就會適用。";
"Suppress warning about pasting a single line ending in a newline when at the shell prompt.\\nThis requires Shell Integration to be installed." = "抑制在 shell 提示符號處貼上以換行符結尾的單行的警告。\\n這需要安裝 Shell 整合。";
"Always turn off focus reporting when host changes?" = "主機變更時一律關閉焦點回報？";
"Always turn off mouse reporting when host changes?" = "主機變更時一律關閉滑鼠回報？";
"Always turn off paste bracketing when host changes?" = "主機變更時一律關閉括號貼上？";
"Suppress the notification that the terminal attempted to access the clipboard but it was denied?" = "是否抑制「終端機嘗試存取剪貼簿但被拒絕」的通知？";
"Suppress the notification that a restored session’s profile no longer exists?" = "是否抑制「還原的工作階段所用設定檔已不存在」的通知？";
"Suppress the notification that a saved arrangement has a bad initial working directory." = "是否抑制「儲存的視窗排列的初始工作目錄無效」的通知。";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable mouse reporting that is shown after a drag followed by Cmd-C when mouse reporting is on?" = "是否抑制「滑鼠回報開啟時，拖拽後按 Cmd-C 所顯示的詢問是否停用滑鼠回報」的通知？";
"Suppress the notification asking if you want to disable resize reporting" = "是否抑制詢問是否停用調整大小回報的通知";
"Suppress announcement that tmux will pause a session." = "抑制 tmux 將暫停工作階段的通告。";
"Send Clear Session to all broadcasted-to sessions?" = "是否向所有廣播目標工作階段傳送「清除工作階段」？";
"Disable control sequence to open URLs?" = "是否停用打開 URL 的控制序列？";
"Open links using the in-app browser?" = "是否使用應用程式內瀏覽器打開連結？";
"Suppress the browser plugin upsell when clicking links?" = "點按連結時是否抑制瀏覽器外掛推廣？";
"Separator inserted between multiple clippings when sending or copying them.\\n" = "傳送或複製多個剪貼內容時插入的分隔符。\\n";
"Delay in seconds before the Return that submits an auto-sent code review.\\n" = "自動傳送程式碼審查時，送出 Return 鍵前的延遲（秒）。\\n";
"When the code-review workgroup toolbar auto-sends review results to the main session, it pastes the results and then sends a Return to submit them. This is how long it waits, after the pasted results finish, before sending that Return. A paste-debouncing TUI (such as Claude Code) processes a paste and a Return that arrive together as one batch, so the Return can be swallowed and the review never submits; the delay makes the Return land in a later read so it submits. The default matches Claude Code’s 500 ms paste-settling window. Set to 0 to send it immediately." = "程式碼審查工具列自動向主工作階段傳送審查結果時，會先貼上結果再傳送一個 Return 鍵來送出。這裡設定的是貼上結果完成後到傳送 Return 鍵之間等待的時間。具備貼上去抖的 TUI 程式（如 Claude Code）會把同時到達的貼上和 Return 作為一個批次處理，導致 Return 被吞掉、審查永遠無法送出；此延遲讓 Return 落在稍後的讀取中，從而成功送出。預設值對應 Claude Code 的 500 毫秒貼上穩定視窗。設為 0 表示立即傳送。";
"Warn before pasting when not at shell prompt?" = "不在 shell 提示符號時貼上前是否警告？";
"Tip of the Day: " = "每日提示：";
"Time between tips (in seconds)" = "提示間隔時間（秒）";
"Enable ad blocking in the web browser?\\nWhen enabled, downloads and applies ad blocking rules from the configured URL." = "是否在網頁瀏覽器中啟用廣告攔截？\\n啟用後會從設定的 URL 下載並套用廣告攔截規則。";
"URL for ad blocking filter list\\nThis should be a JSON file in WebKit content blocker format. The list is downloaded automatically every 24 hours." = "廣告攔截過濾列表的 URL\\n應為 WebKit 內容攔截器格式的 JSON 檔案。列表每 24 小時自動下載一次。";
"Enable HTTP proxy for web browser?\\nWhen enabled, routes all browser traffic through the configured proxy server." = "是否為網頁瀏覽器啟用 HTTP 代理？\\n啟用後所有瀏覽器流量都會經由設定的代理伺服器轉送。";
"HTTP proxy hostname or IP address\\nThe address of the proxy server to use for browser connections." = "HTTP 代理主機名稱或 IP 位址\\n用於瀏覽器連線的代理伺服器位址。";
"HTTP proxy port\\nThe port number of the proxy server." = "HTTP 代理連接埠\\n代理伺服器的連接埠號碼。";
"Location of browser plugin if it cannot be auto-detected" = "無法自動偵測時瀏覽器外掛的位置";
"While loading the default smart selection rules" = "載入預設智慧選取規則時";
"Han (CJK Unified Ideographs)" = "漢字（CJK 統一表意文字）";
"Greek (Greek and Coptic)" = "希臘文（希臘文與科普特文）";
"This histogram shows how much CPU time was used evaluating the regular expression for this trigger over the lifetime of the current terminal session. The X axis gives time in microseconds while the Y axis gives the number of samples which fell in that duration bucket. The vertical red line indicates the mean duration. You can use this to diagnose triggers that cause performance problems." = "此直方圖顯示在目前終端機工作階段的生命週期內，評估此觸發器的正規表示式所耗費的 CPU 時間。橫軸以微秒為單位表示時間，縱軸表示落在該時間區間中的樣本數量。紅色垂直線表示平均耗時。您可以用它來診斷造成效能問題的觸發器。";
"IntelliJ IDEA (Community Edition)" = "IntelliJ IDEA（社群版）";

"%@: %@" = "%@：%@";

"Snippets, notes, or icon customizations changed both on this Mac and in the settings folder “%@” since they were last in sync. Which copy would you like to keep?" = "程式碼片段、備忘錄或圖示自訂在此 Mac 與設定資料夾「%@」中自上次同步後均有變更。您想保留哪個副本？";
